<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">John</book>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">John</para>
  <para style="toc2">John</para>
  <para style="mt">John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kipat cilin Thu na om a, tua Thu khu Pasien tawh na omton a, tua Thu, Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama pen a cil a kipanin Pasien tawh na omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama tungtawnin na zosie pieng a, ama lo tawh a kipiengsah na khat beh om lo hi. A kipiengsah na zosie in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama sungah hinna a nei vua, tua hinna khu mihingte’ khuovah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuomiel lahah tua khuovah tang a, khuomiel in tua khuovah a zo zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien kung panin ang kisawl mi khat om a, a min John ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama tungtawnin mi zosie in a up nadingin tua khuovah thu teci pang dinga ang pei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amama pen khuovah ahi sih a, tua khuovah thu teci pang dinga ang pei hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mikim tunga ang tang ahi tua khuovah tahtah pen leitungah ang pei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama leitungah om a, ama tungtawnin leitung kipiengsah hi; hizongle leitung in ama a thei kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama-a’ ahite kungah ama pei a, hinanle ama’ mite in ama na sang lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama sangin ama’ min a um zosiete tungah Pasien’ tate suo thei nading thuneina a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua banga a suoh mite pen silesa-a pieng hi loin mihing’ deidan banga pieng zong ahi sih a, Pasien’ deidan banga a pieng hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale thu in mihing bangin pieng a, hepina le thuman thutah tawh kidimin eite lahah om a, Pa in a neisun Tapa khat’ minthanna bangin ama’ minthanna i mu zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />(Ama tawh kisai John in teci pang a, “Tampa pen kang gen mipa ahi a, ‘Ka nua-a ang pei ahi vangin kei masanga na om zo ahi ziehin kei sangin ama a lienzaw hi,’ ci-in a kiko hi,” a ci hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama’ kicinna panin eite in hepina thupha khatzaw khat i nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moses tungtawnin thukham na kipie hi; Jesu Khris tungtawnin hepina le thuman thutah ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koima in Pasien a mu ngai sih hi. Pa’ lungtang tawh kinai-a om Tapa khat beh in ama ei theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jew mite in, “Nang koi na hei?,” ci-in John a dong dingin Jerusalem panin siempute le Levi-te a sawl lai-un, John’ teci panna tam bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama ki-im loin kipulah a, “Kei Messiah ka hi sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale amate in, “Tua ahile koi na hiei? Elijah na mah? ci-in a dong uhi. Ama in, “Ka hi sih hi,” a ci hi. “Kamsang na hi amah?” a cikia ule, “Hi sing,” ci-in dawngkia leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah, “Nang koi na hiei? Ko ei sawlte kungah ka genkia thei nadingun ko kungah dawnna khat ei nei in. Nang le nang koi hi’ng na kici ei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />John in, “Kamsang Isaiah’ gen ma bangin, ‘ Topa pei nading lampi tangsah un,’ ci-in gamlah-ah a kiko aw ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate pen Pharisee-te sawl ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in a kungah, “Tua ahile nang, Messiah lah hi lo, Elijah zong hi lo, kamsangpa lah hi lo na hi leh bang zieha mi na baptize ahei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />John in amate kungah, “Keima in tui tawh mi ka baptize hi. Note lahah na thei lo uh khat a ding khinkhian a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ama ka nua-a ang peipa ahi hi; kei pen a kedap khau sut dingin zong ka kilawm sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami pen John in mite a baptize-na mun Jordan gungal Bethany khuo-a pieng thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A zing ciengin John in ama lam zuon a a pei Jesu a mu ciengin, “Tanah leitung’ mawna a puo Pasien tuuno a om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Ka nua-ah kei sanga a lienzaw khat ang pei ding hi, azieh pen kei ka pien masangin ama a na om zo tabo hi, ka cipa khu tampa ahi hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kei mama in ama ka thei ngai sih hi; ahi vangin tui tawh ama baptize dinga kang peina thu pen Israel-te tungah ama a kilah nading ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuale John teci pang a, “Vantung panin vakhu bangin Hlagau Siengtho hing kumsuh a, ama tunga khawl ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ke’n ama ka thei khah lo vangin, tui tawh mite baptize dinga ei sawlpa in, ‘A tungah Hla kumsuhin a khawl na mu pa uh pen Hlagau Siengtho tawh mite a baptize ding pa ahi hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kei mama in ka mu zo ta a, tam mipa pen Pasien’ Tapa ahi hi, ci-in teci ka pang zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A zing ciengin a nuazuite lahah ni tawh John a dinton laitahin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />ama in Jesu a pei mu a, “En un, tanah Pasien’ Tuuno a om hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nuazui ni tegel in tami a thugen a zah ciengin Jesu nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesu zong kihei-in a nua a zui lam gel a mu ciengin, “Bang sui na hi vuoi?” a ci hi. Ama gel in, “Rabbi (tua pen Siepa a ci nopna hi), hei-a om na hei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama in, “Hing pei unlen hing en un,” a ci hi. Ama gel pei-in a opna mun a va mu ta vua, tua ni-in ama kungah a taam uhi. Khumi hun pen nitah nai li pawl a hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />John thugen za-a Jesu nua a zui nite lahah khat pen Simon Peter’ sanggampa Andrew ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in a sanggampa Simon mu masa pen a, ama kungah, “Messiah (Sathau kinupa a ci nopna) ka mu ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama in Jesu kungah Simon peipi a, Jesu in ama enin, “Nang, John’ tapa Simon na hi hi. Cephas ang kici ta ding hi,” a ci hi. (Peter ci-in kilet hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A zing ciengin Galilee ah Jesu pei a sawm hi. Ama in Philip a mu ciengin ama kungah, “Ei zui in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Philip pen Andrew le Peter-te’ khuo Bethsaida pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Philip in Nathanael mu a, ama kungah, “Moses in thukham laibu sunga a giel, kamsangte in zong a na giel Nazareth khuomi Joseph’ tapa Jesu i mu ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nathanael in ama kungah, “Nazareth khuo ah sil hoi a pieng thei ding amah?” a ci hi. Philip in ama kungah, “Hing pei inlen hing en in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesu in ama kung zuon a a pei Nathanael a mu bepin, “A zuou ngai lo Israel mi tahtah khat tanah a om hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nathanael in, “Kei hei-a nei thei ahei?” ci-in a dong hi. Jesu in, “Philip in ang hlat masang, theikung nei-ah na op lai-in kang mu zo tabo hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nathanael in, “Rabbi aw, nang Pasien’ Tapa na hi hi! Israel kumpipa zong na hi hi!” ci-in a dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu in, “Theikung nei-ah na op lai-in kang mu zo hi, kang ci zieha nei up amah? Tamte sanga a thupizaw nate na mu lai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, note in van kihong na mu ding vua, Mihing Tapa tungah Pasien’ vantung mite a kumsuh le a kato na mu ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in Galilee gam Cana khuo ah mopawi khat om a, tuanah Jesu’ nu a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu le a nuazuite zong tua mopawi-ah kihlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lenggazu a tawp ciengin a nu in Jesu kungah, “Lenggazu a nei nawn sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu in, “Numei aw, nang le kei bang kisai laizang i hei? Ka hun a tung nai sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nu in nasemte kungah, “Ang gen bangbangin na gamta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua munah gallan sawm ni sawm thum bang a ta, Judah-te’ kisiensuona-a zah ding suong tuibeel guh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Tuibeel ah tui dim un,” a ci hi. Amate in zong a dimletin a dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Tu-in themkhat sawh unlen pawi uhpa kungah va peipi ta un,” a ci hi. Amate in zong tua ma bangin a va peipi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawi uhpa in lenggazu a suoh tui a ciep ciengin, (tua tui a dim nasemte a thei vangin) hei pana pieng ahei, ci ama in a thei sih a, tuale pawi uhpa in zinei pa hlanin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mite in lengga zulawi a hawm masa a, lenglate in a kham zaw ciengin a daute a hawm pan uhi. Ahi vangin nang in tu dongin zulawi na hen lai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu in Galilee gam Cana khuo ah a masa pen tami na lamdang bawlin, tuaci’n ama’ minthanna a kilangsah hi; tuale a nuazuite in zong ama a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Capernaum khuo ah a nu, a sanggamte, le a nuazuite tawh pei-in khum tahah bakhat sung a taam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah-te’ Peisan pawi ding ang nai ta ahi ziehin Jerusalem ah Jesu a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in biehinn sungah bawng, tuu, vakhu zuate le sumkhelna sabuoi tunga a to sumkhelte a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in mi sat nading khauhuolte bawlin biehinnpi panin tuute, bawngte a unpi-un a delmang hi. Sumkhelte’ dangkatang teng zong thezah pieh a, a sabuoite uzong a lumlepieh gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in vakhu zuate kungah, “Tam teng zong tam panin lakhiemang ta un! Ka Pa’ inn vanzuana mun suohsah sih un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nuazuite in, “Na inn dinga deiluotna in ei netum ding hi,” ci-a kigielsa thu a phawhkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jew mite in ama kungah, “Tamte na bawl thei nadingin bang lim nei lah thei diei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Tami biehinnpi sisue locin ni thum sungin ka dingsah kia ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jew mite in, “Tami biehinnpi kum sawm li le kum guh sung tah kilam ahi hi, nang in ni thum sungin na dingsah zo ngel diei mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a pumpi ahi biehinn gen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sina panin a thawkia zaw ciengin a nuazuite in ama gensa tam thu a phawhkia vua, tuaci’n amate in Lai Siengtho le Jesu’ gensa thute a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in Jerusalem khuo ah Peisan pawi hun sungin ama’ bawl limte a mu ziehun ama’ min a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama lam panin Jesu in amate a muong sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ama ma in mikim sungah bang om ahei, ci thei zo ta ahi ziehin, koima in ama kungah mi khatpo’ thu teci a kipan ding kisam sa lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nicodemus a kici Judah makai khat om a, ama pen Pharisee-te khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zan lai-in Jesu kungah pei-in ama kungah, “Rabbi aw, nang pen Pasien kung pana ang pei siepa khat na hi lam kang thei uhi; azieh pen Pasien lo tawh na bawl tami limte koima in bawl thei lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, mi khatpo tunglam panin a suokia sih leh Pasien’ manggam a mu thei sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nicodemus in, “Mi khat a khangham zaw ciengin bangci suokia thei ding ahei? A nu gil sungah lutkia-in a suohkia thei ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu in, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, koipo tui le hlagau tawh a suokia sih leh Pasien’ manggam a lut thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tahsa-a suona in tahsa hi a, Hlagau-a suona in hlagau ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Nang na hi leh tunglam panin na suohkia a ngai hi,’ kang ci ciengin lamdang sa sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hui zong a nopna popo-ah lang a, a gin na zah vangin hei pana hing lang hi a, hei lam zuon ahei, ci na thei sih hi. Hlagau-a suoh tapo zong tua ma bang ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nicodemus in ama kungah, “Tami thu a bangci pien thei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu in ama dawng a, “Nang Israel-te’ sie khat lawmlawm in tam thute na tel sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“A tahtah a kang ci-in, kote in ka theisa thute kang gen vua, ka musa thute beh teci kang pang uhi; ahi vangin nang in ka teci panna uh na sang zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note kungah leitung thu tawh kisai kang gen ciengin na up sih uleh vantung thu hing gen leng bang na ci up thei ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vantung pana ang kumsuh Mihing Tapa simlo vantungah a kato koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses in gamlahah gul a khai bangin Mihing Tapa kikhai ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua khu ama a um tapo in kumtawn hinna a nga nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Pasien in leitung a it seng ziehin a tapa a um mi zosie in kisie loin kumtawn hinna a nei thei nadingin a tapa neisun a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A tahtahin Pasien in leitung mawsahna thukhen dingin a Tapa leitunga ang sawl ahi sih a, ama tungtawnin leitung in hutdamna a nga thei nading hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama a umte in mawsahna thukhenna a thuoh sih ding uhi; ahi vangin ama a um lote in Pasien’ Tapa neisun’ min a up lo ziehun mawsahna thukhenna a thuoh zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale thukhenna a thuohna uh a hang pen leitungah khuovah hing tung zo napi a gamtat uh a siet luot ziehin mihingte in khuovah sangin khuomiel deizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sietna a bawl mi zosie in amau’ gamtatnate a kilah lo nadingin khuovah a muda vua, khuovah sungah a pei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin thuman-a a gamtate in amau’ gamtatna pen Pasien sunga gamta ahina uh kicien tahin a kimu thei nadingin khuovah sungah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Judah gamah Jesu le a nuazuite a pei vua, khum munah amate tawh bakhat sung hun zangin mite a baptize hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Salim khuo gei-a Aenon munah tui a tam ziehin John in zong tuanah mite a baptize hi; tuale mite a kiphamatin pei-in a ki-baptize uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />thong sungah John a kikhum nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in kisiensuona tungtang thu tawh kisai-in John’ nuazuite le Jew mi khat kikalah thu kikupna khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />John kungah amate pei-in, “Sie aw, Jordan gun galkhatah nang tawh a omton ngai, ama’ thu teci na panna pa pen tu-in tanah omin mite a baptize a, mi zosie in ama a zuon uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />John in, “Vantung panin a kipieh sih leh koima in bangma nga thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Kei, Messiah ka hi sih a, a masanga ei kisawl pa ka hi bo hi,’ ci-a ka gen khu nomate mama ka teci na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Monei pa pen zinei pa ahi hi. Zinei pa kungah dingin ama’ thu ngai-a om a guolpa in zinei pa’ aw a zah ziehin a kipah mama hi. Tua thu ziehin ka lungdamna a bukim ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in khanlam manaw ding a, kei ka hile kiemlam ka manaw ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tunglam pana ang peipa khu mi zosie tungah a om hi; lei pana piengpa pen lei-a’ ahi a, leitung thute a gen hi. Vantung pana ang peipa ahile mi zosie’ tungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in mu-in a zahsa thute teci pang a, hizongle koima in a teci panna a sang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama’ teci panna a sang poma in Pasien pen a thuman hi, ci-in a kipsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pasien’ sawl mi in Pasien’ thu a gen hi, azieh pen ama in tua mipa tungah ciengtan om loin Hlagau a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pa in Tapa it a, ama’ khut sungah na zosie a koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tapa a um mi poma in kumtawn hinna a nei hi; Tapa’ thu a mang lo mi poma in hinna mu lo ding a, Pasien’ lungthahna a thuohzaw lai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Jesu in John sangin nuazui tam suohsah zaw-in mi tam baptize zaw hi, ci thu Pharisee-te in a zah lam uh Jesu in a thei ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />- a baptize-pa pen Jesu ahi sih a, a nuazuite ahi zaw hi-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama in Judea gam nuasie-in Galilee ah a peikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in Samaria gam nawhin a pei lo phamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob in a tapa Joseph a pieh leitang gei-ah Sychar a kici Samaria gam khuopi khatah a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum munah Jacob’ tuikhuh a om a, a khuolzin a gim ziehin tua tuikhuh gei-ah Jesu a to hi. Khum hun pen sunkim laitah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui tawi dingin Samaria numei khat pei a, Jesu in tua nu kungah, “Tui ei dawnsah vawi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Neh ding lei-in khuopi sungah a nuazuite a pei sieng ta uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samaria numei nu in ama kungah, “Nang Judah mi khat in bangci dan a kei Samaria numei khat kunga tui nei nget thei ahei?” a ci hi. (Jew mite le Samaria-te sil bangma a kitang sih uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu in tua nu kungah, “Pasien’ letsong thei-in na kungah, ‘Tui ei dawnsah in,’ ang cipa khu a theicien hi lacin, ama kungah tui na ngenzaw ding a, ama in hinna tui ang pie ding hi,” ci in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numei nu in ama kungah, “Sie aw, nang in tuikhai nading bangma na nei sih a, tuikhuh lah thuh mama hi. Tua hinna tui hei sunga na lah ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami tuikhuh pen ka pu uh Jacob ei pieh ahi a, ama le a tate-a kipanin a gan khawite in tami tuikhuh a na zah uh ahi hi, tua ahile nang khumpa sanga a lienzaw na hi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu in, “Tami tui a dawn poma a dangta kia ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ahi vangin amate ka pieh ding tui a dawn poma dangta ngai nawn lo ding hi. Ka pieh ding tui a dawnte sungah kumtawn hinna tuinahin a pul ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua numei nu in ama kungah, “Siepa, ka dang a ta nawn lo nading le tam sunga tui tawi-a ka pei nawn lo nadingin tua tui kei ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu in tua nu kungah, “Va pei-in na pasal va hlan ta’nlen tanah hing peikia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numei nu in, “Ke’n pasal ka nei sih hi,” ci-in a dawng hi. Jesu in, ‘Pasal nei sing,’ na ci a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen pasal nga na nei ngai a, tu-a na nei pen zong na pasal ahi sih hi. Na thugen man hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numei nu in, “Siepa aw, nang kamsang khat na hi lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate un tami muol tungah Pasien a na bie vua, ahi vangin note in lah Pasien bieh nading pen Jerusalem hi bo, na ci zel uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in tua nu kungah, “Numei aw, kei ei um in, tami muol tungah hitale Jerusalem khuo ah hitale Pa na bieh nawn lo ding uh hun ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Note in na thei lopi uh na bie uhi; kote in ka theite ka bie uhi, azieh pen hutdamna khu Jew mite tung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien a bie tahtahte in lungsim le thuman thutah tawh a bieh ding uh hun ang tung ding a, tu-in tanah ang tung ta hi, azieh pen Pasien in tua banga a bie ding mite a sui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasien pen Hlagau ahi a, ama a biete in lungsim le thuman thutah tawh a bie ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numei nu in ama kungah, “Messiah (Khris kici pa) ang pei ding ci thu ka thei hi. Ama ang pei ciengin na zosie ei lah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu in tua nu kungah, “Nang ang hopi keima khu tuapa ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zaw lien ciengin a nuazuite a tung uhi. Numei khat tawh ama a kiho pen lamdang a sa mama vua, ahi vangin koima in, “Bang dei na hei?” ahi sihle “Bang dinga ama na hopi ahei?” a ci sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin a tuibel nuasie-in khuopi sungah numei nu peikia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hing pei un, ka gamtatna zosie ei gen mipa hing en ta un! Ama Messiah ahi thei sih ding amah?” ci-in mite kungah a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in a khuopi uh nuasie-in Jesu kung a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua kikalin a nuazuite in, “Siepa bangkhat ne in,” ci in a zawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amate kungah, “Na thei lo uh neh ding an ka nei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n a nuazuite in, “Koi khatpo in an a puoh zo ahi ta diei izaw?” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Ei sawlpa’ deina banga ka sep ding le ama’ nasep ka man sieng ding pen ka an ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hla li zaw ciengin anlah hun ang tung ding hi, ci hi lo uh na mah? Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, na kim na pam en un, lo lai-ah ante minin lah hun ta hi, ci thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Anla pa in thaman a nga zo ta a, ama in kumtawn hinna a nga thei nadingin an kaikhawm a, tuaci’n khaitu pa le anla pa a lungdamton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Azieh pen, ’ Mi khat in vaw a, adang khat in bu a at hi,’ a na kici thu pen a man ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Keima in na hlaw lona mun vuah a at dingin note kang sawl hi. Mi dangte in a hlo vua, note na hi ule amate’ hlawna lo-a a lut na hi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Numei nu in, “Ka gamtatna zosie ama in ei gen hi,” ci-a teci a pan ziehin tua khuo-a Samaria mi tampite in Jesu a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu kungah Samaria-te a tun uh ciengin amate kunga a tam dingin a zawl vua, tuanah ni ni sung Jesu a tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuale ama’ thugente ziehin thu um mi tampi a kibelap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in numei nu kungah, “Na thugenna zieha a um ka hi nawn sih vua, ko mama in ka za vua, tampa pen leitung hundampa tahtah hi, ci-in ka thei uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ni ni zaw ciengin tua mun panin ama peikhie-in Galilee gam a zuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />(bangzieh ahei cile Jesu mama in kamsang khat, ama’ gamah kipahta ngai lo hi, ci-in teci pang ngaisa ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Galilee gamah ama a tun ciengin Galilee mite in a na lamdot uhi, bangzieh ahei cile amate in Jerusalem pawi-ah a silbawl zosie a mu ngai vua, amate mama zong pawi simin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuisih, lengga zu a suosahna mun Cana khuo ah Jesu a peikia hi. Tua laitahin Capernaum khuo ah milien khat’ tapa dam loin a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua mipa in Judea gam panin Galilee gamah Jesu a tun lam a zah ciengin peisuhin a tapa a damsah nadingin a thum hi, azieh pen a tapa a si dihtah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama kungah, “Note in lim le na lamdangte na mu sih uleh na um sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Milien pa in ama kungah, “Siepa aw, ka tapa a si masangin hing hawsuh ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Pei ta’n, na tapa dam ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua pa in Jesu’ thugen umin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Lampi-ah a peisuh laitahin a silate in a na dawn vua, “Na tapa hing ta,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a noptuom hun amate a dong leh, “Zani sun nai khat laitahin a cithuo a theu hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Khum hun pen, “Na tapa a dam ding hi,” ci-in Jesu in a na gen hun lien ahi lam a pa in a thei ciengin ama le a innkuonpi zosie in Jesu a um pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tam pen Jesu in Judea gam panin Galilee gam a tun zaw a na lamdang bawl a niveina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Jew mite’ pawi khat om a, Jesu zong Jerusalem ah a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khuo-a Tuu Tunkot gei-ah Hebrew hamin Beth-zatha a kici buol tuikhuh khat om a, tua buol in talap nga nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua talapte sungah mittaw, khelbai, phalsi-a kipanin a dammaw mi tampitah in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tui kilaw ding ngahin a lum uhi; bangzieh ahei cile buolah Topa’ vantungmi khat kumsuhin a hunhunin tua tui a lawh thei zel hi; tua tui a kilaw zaw ciengin a sunga a kumsuh masa penpen mipa in bangbang natna vei tale a dam pai lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khum sungah kum sawm thum le kum giet sung a cina khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu in tua sunga a lum mipa a mu ciengin ama in a lup zaw a sawt zo lam thei a, tuale ama in tua pa kungah, “Na dam nuom ei mah?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cina pa in, “Siepa aw, tui a kilaw ciengin buol sungah ei koi ding mi koima ka nei sih hi; tuale ka pei ciengin ka masangah midang khat a na kumsuh paipai hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu in tuapa kungah, “Ding in, na lupna la inlen pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuapa zong thakhatin dam a, a lupna la-in a pei pai hi. Khum ni pen Sabbath ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jew mite in damna nga pa kungah, “Tuni pen Sabbath ni ahi hi; na lupna puoh pen thukham tawh kituoh lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in amate kungah, ‘Kei ei damsah pa in na lupna la inlen pei in,’ ei ci hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in, ‘Na lupna puo inlen pei-in,’ ang cipa koi ahei?” ci-in ama a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua munah a om mihonte lahah Jesu peimang zieu ahi ziehin a kidamsah pa in a damsah pa koi ahei, ci a thei ta vanuh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Jesu in biehinnpi sungah tua mipa mu a, ama kungah, “En in, na dam sieng ta hi! Na tungah a siezaw khat ang tun lo nadingin mawna bawl nawn sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipa pei-in ama a damsah pa Jesu ahi hi, ci-in Jew mite kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sabbath ni-in Jesu in tam bang nate a sep ziehin Jew mite in ama bawlsiet ding a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amate kungah, “Ka Pa in tudong na sem lai a, ke’n zong ka sem lai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam bangin Jesu in sabbath ni a sietsah tham loin, Pasien pen a Pa hisah a, ama le Pasien pen a kikimin a koi ziehin Jew mite in ama tha dingin a sui semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, Tapa in ama thu-in bangma bawl thei lo a, Pa’ bawl a mute beh a bawl hi; azieh pen Pa’ sep teng ma Tapa in zong sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pa in Tapa it a, a silbawl zosie Tapa tungah lah hi; note in lamdang na sah dingun Pa in tamte sanga a lienzaw sep dingte Tapa tungah a lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pa in misite thosahin hinna a pieh ma bangin Tapa in zong a deisahte hinna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pa in koima tungah thu a khen sih hi, ahi vangin ama in Tapa tungah thukhenna zosie a ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi zosie in Pa a zatah bangin Tapa zong a zatah nadingin Pa in koima tungah thu khen loin thukhen nading thu zosie Tapa a pie hi. Tapa a zatah lo mi poma in ama a sawlpa Pa zong a zatah lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, koipo in ka thu za-in keima ei sawlpa a up leh kumtawn hinna a nei zo ta a, thukhenna thuoh nawn loin sina pan peikhie-in hinna ah a tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, misite in Pasien Tapa’ aw a zah ding uh hun le a za tapo a hin nading uh hun ang tung ding a, tu-in zong ang tung zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen Pa in ama sungah hinna a nei ma bangin Tapa in zong ama sungah hinna a nei thei nading thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama Mihing Tapa ahi ziehin Pa in ama tungah thukhen thei nading thuneina a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami thu-ah lamdang sa sih un; azieh pen han sunga om zosie in ama’ aw za-in hansung panin ang pusuo ding uh hun ang tung ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuale a hoi a gamtate in hinna nga dingin ang thokia ding a, sietna a bawl mite zong thukhenna thuoh dingin ang thokia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima’ thu-in bangma ka bawl thei sih hi. Ka zah bangin thu ka khen hi; ka thukhenna a dih hi, azieh pen keima’ deina ka sui sih a, kei ei sawlpa’ deina ka suizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Keima tawh kisai teci pang leng ka teci panna man lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Keima adingin teci a pang midang khat a om a, ama in keima dinga a teci panna pen dih hi, ci ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Note in John kungah mi na sawl vua, ama in thuman thutah thu teci a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua banga mihing’ teci pannate ka sang hi, ka cina hi loin note in hutdamna na nga thei nadingun tam thute ka gen ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama pen meivah bangin kuongin a tang pimpem a, note in ama’ khuovah sungah bakhat sung nopsah ding na nuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahi vangin John’ teci panna sanga a lienzaw teci panna khat ka nei hi. Pa in ka man sieng dinga ei pieh nasepte le tu-a ka septe in Pa pen keima ei sawlpa ahi lam keima tanga teci a pang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuale keima ei sawlpa ahi Pa mama in zong kei tangin teci a pang zo hi. Note in ama’ aw na za ngai sih vua, a lim a mel zong na mu ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama a sawlpa na up lo ziehun ama’ thu zong na sung vuah a teng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Lai Siengtho simna tawh tawntung hinna kinga thei ding na sah ziehun Lai Siengtho na lim-et mama uhi; tuate khu keima’ thu teci pang ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hizongle note in hinna na nei nadingun keima kungah nang pei nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Keima in mihingte tung panin minthanna ka sang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in Pasien’ itna lungsim na nei lo uh ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ka Pa’ min suonga kang pei vangin nei sang sih uhi; ama’ min suongin midang khat ang pei hileh na sang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Khatlekhat kiphatna sang napi ucin, Pasien khat beh tung pana ang pei phatna na sui lopi uh na bangci up thei ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Pa mai-ah note ang mawsah dingin ei ngaisun sih un; note ang mawsah pen na kinepna pa uh Moses ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moses um na hi uleh, kei zong nei up ding uh ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama in keima’ thu a giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Note in a laigielte na up sih uleh ka thugente na bangci up thei ding uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Tiberias Tuipi zong a kici Galilee Tuipi galkhatah Jesu a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi tampite in cinate tungah a bawl lim lamdangte a mu ziehun ama’ nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu zong muol tungah ka to-in khum tahah a nuazuite tawh a toton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu-in Judah-te’ Peisan pawi nai mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu a khuoda leh ama kung a zuon mihonpite mu a, tuaci’n ama in Philip kungah, “Tam mite neh ding an hei sungah i lei ding vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam pen Philip a zelahna-a a gen ahi bo hi, azieh pen amama in a bawl ding a theisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Philip in, “Mikim in themkhat cietin a tan ding uh an lei nadingin hla guh thaman in zong cin lo ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nuazuite lah panin Peter’ sanggampa Andrew in ama kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tamnah anlum pum nga le nga tawn ni a nei naupang khat om hi. Ahi vangin mihing tazapi lahah tam teng banga gei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu in, “Mite tosah un,” a ci hi. Tua munah lopa tampi a po hi; tuaci’n amate a to vua, pasal tul nga bang a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in zong anlum la-in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin a to mite lahah a hawm hi; tua ma bangin nga zong la-in amau’ deiza cietin a hawmpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kham zaw ciengun a nuazuite kungah, “A thelthang bangma a op lo nadingin khawnla nengkie teng luoh un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in anlum nga sungah khawnla nengkie teng a luoh vua, seu sawm le seu ni a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite in ama’ bawl lim lamdangte a mu uh ciengin, “Tampa pen leitunga ang pei ding kamsang tahtah khat hi ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mite pei-in kumpi dinga a paumat ding uh Jesu in a thei bepin ama guohin muol tungah a geldap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nitah ciengin tuipi-ah a nuazuite a peisuh vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />gunkuong khatah tuongin Capernaum zuon dingin tuipi a kantan uhi. Tua munah khuo miel ta a, Jesu lah amate kungah a tung nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huipi a hat ziehin tui a kilawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tai thum tai li bang gunkuong a haw zaw ciengun amate lam ang zuon, tui tunga ang pei Jesu a mu vua, a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amate kungah, “Keima ka hi hi; zau sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in gunkuong tungah kipah tahin ama a tuongsah vua, tuale a gunkuong zong a tun nading mun vuah mallang tahin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zing ciengin tuipi galkhatah a omlai mihonpite in tua sungah gunkuong khat beh om a, Jesu lah a nuazuite tawh tua gunkuong tungah tuongton loin amate guoh a pei a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin khomun a nehna uh mun gei-ah Tiberius panin gunkuong pawlkhat a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n tuipi gei-ah mihonpite in Jesu le a nuazuite a op nawn lo lam a thei ciengun, Jesu sui dingin gunkuong tung tuongin Capernaum ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in tuipi galkhatah ama a mu ciengun ama kungah, “Siepa, bang hun a tasung na tung na hei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu in, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, na lamdangte na mu zieh vua kei ei sui hi loin, an kham taha na neh zieh vua ei sui na hi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A sie thei an nga nadingin hakat sih unlen, Mihing Tapa in ang pieh ding kumtawn hinna dinga a kimang thei an nga nadingin hakatzaw un. Azieh pen Pa Pasien in ama tungah a ciemtena seal a khen zo ta hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “Pasien’ na ka sep thei nadingun bang bawl ding ka hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Ama in ang sawlpa na upna uh pen Pasien’ nasep ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in ama kungah, “Kote in zong mu-a kang up thei nadingun lim lamdang bang ei lah ding na hei? Bang teng bawl ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lai Siengtho sungah, ‘Ama in vantung panin a neh ding uh khomun a pie hi,’ ci-in a kigiel ma bangin, i pu i pate in gamlahah manna a ne uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, Moses in vantung panin note khomun ang pie sih a, vantung panin khomun ang pie pa pen ka Pa ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile vantung panin hing pei-in leitung mite hinna a piepa pen Pasien’ khomun ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “ Topa , tami khomun ko ei pie suoh ta’n,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungh, “Keima in hinna khomun ka hi hi. Kei kunga ang pei poma gilkiel ngai nawn lo ding a, kei ei um poma a dangta ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanle kei ei mu zo napi ucin nei um sih uhi, ci-in kang gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pa in kei ei pieh mi zosie ka kungah ang pei ding vua, tuaci’n ka kunga ang pei poma ka notmang ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima’ dei bang bawl dinga vantung pana ang kumsuh ka hi sih a, keima ei sawlpa’ dei bang bawl dinga ang kumsuh ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Keima ei sawlpa’ deina ahile, ama in ei piehsa zosie khat zong mansuo loin, ni tawp ni cienga ka thawsah ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tapa mu a, a um zosie in kumtawn hinna nei-in ni tawpni ciengin amate ka thawsah ding pen ka Pa’ deina tahtah ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Keima in vantung pana ang kumsuh khomun ka hi hi,” a ci ziehin ama tungah Jew mite a phun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in, “Tampa a nu le a pa i thei hi a, ama Joseph’ tapa Jesu hi lel lo amah? Tu-in ama in, ‘Vantung pana ang kumsuh ka hi hi,’ bang dinga a ci thei ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Khatlekhat kiphunsan sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keima ei sawlpa Pa in a huoi lote koima ka kungah ang pei thei sih ding hi; ni tawp ni ciengin keima in tua mipa ka thosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kamsangte’ laibu sungah, ‘Pasien in amate a unpi-un a hil ding hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi. Pa tung panin thu ngai-in a kunga kisin poma kei kung pana ang pei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tam bang ka ci ciengin Pa kung pana ang pei mi khat simlo khatpo in Pa mu zo hi, a ci ka hi sih hi; ama in Pa a mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, a um mi in kumtawn hinna a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kei pen hinna khomun ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na pu na pate un gamlahah manna ne-in a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tami pen vantung pana ang peisuh khomun ahi a, a ne mi poma a si sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Keima in vantung pana ang peisuh hinna khomun ka hi hi. Tami khomun a ne poma kumtawnin a hing den ding hi; leitung mite hinna dinga ka pieh ding khomun pen keima’ tahsa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jew mite in, “Tam pa in i neh dingin a tahsa bang ei ci pieh thei ding ahei?,” ci-in a kisel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, note in Mihing Tapa’ sa na neh sih vua, a si na dawn sih uleh na sung vuah hinna na nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Keima’ sa ne-a keima’ si a dawn mite in kumtawn hinna nei a, keima in nitawp ni ciengin amate ka thosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka sa pen neh ding an tahtah ahi a, ka si zong khu dawn ding tui tahtah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ka sa ne a, ka si a dawn poma keima sungah teng a, kei zong ama sungah ka teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A hingzing Pa in keima ei sawlin Pa ziehin ka hin ma bangin, kei zieha a ne poma zong a hing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tami pen vantung pana ang kumsuh khomun ahi a, na pu na pate un ne-in a si veve utawh kibang lo hi. Ahi vangin tami khomun a ne poma a hing zing ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ama in tam thu pen Capernaum khuo kikhopna inn sungah a thuhil lai-a a gen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />A nuazui tampite in tua thu a zah ciengun, “Tami thuhilna hahsa mama hi. Koi in pom thei ding ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Ahi vangin a nuazuite in tam thu zieha a phunphun uh Jesu in a thei ciengin amate kungah, “Tam thu in note ang lungkiesah amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tua ahile Mihing Tapa a opna ngai-ah a kato a mu hi locin bang na ci ding vuoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hinna a pie pen hlagau ahi a, tahsa in kimanna a nei sih hi; na kung vua kang gen thute hlagau thu ahi a, hinna zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Ahi vangin note lahah a um lo pawlkhat a om hi,” a ci hi. Tua banga a ci theina pen Jesu in a cil a patin koite in um lo a, koite in ama lebawl ding ahei, ci thu a theisa ahi zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Tami thu ziehin Pa phalna om loin ka kungah koima ang pei thei sih ding hi, ci-in kang gen zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tami thu a zah ziehun a nuazui tampite kinuale-in ama tawh a kithuo nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu in sawm le nite kungah, “No zong na peimang nuom vuoi mah?” ci-in dong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Simon Peter in, “ Topa , ko koi kunga pei son ding ka hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Nangma in kumtawn hinna thu na nei a, kote in a Siengtho Pasien na hi lam kang um vua, zong kang thei uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “No, sawm le nite, kang teel na hi sih uh amah? Hizongle note lahah khat pen dawimangpa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tam pen sawm le nite lahah ama a leheh ding pa, Simon Iscariot tapa’ Judas a genna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Galilee gam sungah Jesu a zin kawikawi hi. Ama tha nading Jew mite in hunlem a sui ziehun Judea gamah ama a zin nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu-in Judah-te’ Buh Pawi a nai mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n a sanggamte in ama kungah, “Na nuazuite in na nasepna a mu thei nadingun tam sung nuasie inlen Judea gamah pei in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />azieh pen mipi thei ding a nuom poma in dapsep ngai lo hi. Tam thute na bawl leh leitung mite theisah vet in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(Azieh pen a sanggamte nangawn in ama a um sih uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Ka hun tung nai lo hi, hizongle no hun ahile a lemtang zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leitung in note ang muda thei sih vangin kei ei muda hi, azieh pen a silbawlte hoi lo hi, ci-a teci ka pan zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No mama in tua pawi va sim ta un. Keima’ hun tungkim nai lo ahi ziehin tua pawi kang sim nai sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami thu a genzaw ciengin Galilee gamah a tamsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin pawi sim dingin a sanggamte a pei zaw ciengin ama zong mipi thei loin a va hawdap ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawi sungah Jew mite in, “Jesu hei-a om ahei?” ci-in dongin a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n mihonpi lahah ama’ thu tawh kisai kimawsietna lienpi a om hi. Mi pawlkhatte in, “Ama mihoi khat ahi hi,” a ci vua, adangte in, “Hi lo hi, ama pen mipite sol ahi bo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in Jew mite a giin ziehun koima in a langtangin a gen ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawi bawl a kimsuhin biehinnpi sungah Jesu pei to-in thuhil ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jew mite in, “Tami pa in sinna bangma a nei ngai lopi, tam bang theina a bangci nei thei son adiei?” ci-in lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Ka thuhilte keima-a’ ahi sih a, keima ei sawlpa-a’ ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien’ deina bang sem dinga a khensat poma in tua thuhilna pen Pasien kung pan amah, ahi sihle keima’ thu beh gen ka hei, ci a thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau’ thu a gente pen amau’ minthan nading beh sui ahi uhi; ahi vangin a sawlpa’ minthan nading a sui mite pen mi thuman ahi vua, amate sungah zuouthu om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses in note thukham hing pie zo hi lo amah? Hizongle khat mama in zong tua thukham na zui sih uhi. Bang dinga kei tha nading hun lemtang na sui uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihonpite in, “Nang dawivei na hi hi! Tha dinga ang sui koi ahiei?” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Na khat ka bawl a, na unpi-un lamdang na sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moses in teptan ding thu note ang pie a, (a tahtahin tam pen Moses’ pat hi loin pupite’ pat ahi zaw hi), note in sabbath ni-in mi khat’ tep na tanpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses’ thukham a kipalsat lo nadingin sabbath ni-in mi khat’ tep kitan thei ahileh sabbath ni-in mi khat’ pumpi ka damsah ziehin bang dingin kei tungah lungthah na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A putham muna tawh thukhen sih unlen, a thukhenna man tawh thu na khen un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in Jerusalem mi pawlkhat in, “Tha dinga a suisui pa uh tampa hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama tanah om a, mipi zahin thu gen napi ama kungah bangma a gen ngam sih uhi! Tampa Messiah ahi hi, ci-in thunei vaihawmte in a thei tahtah ding vuoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanle eite in tam mipa hei pana ang kipan ahei, ci i thei uhi; ahi vangin Messiah ang pei ciengin ama hei pana hing pei ci koima in thei lo ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin biehinnpi sungah thu a hil kawmin Jesu kiko a, “Note in kei nei thei vua, kei hei pana hing pei ci zong na thei uhi. Keima thu tawh ang pei ka hi sih hi. Keima ei sawlpa thudih a, ahi vangin note in ama na thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in keima ei sawl a, ama kung pana ang pei ka hi ziehin ama ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama mat ding a hanciem vua, ahi vangin a hun a tun nai lo ziehin koima in ama tungah khut a nga sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanle mihon lahah mi tampite in ama a um vua, “Messiah ang pei ciengin tampa sangin na lamdang a tamzaw ang lah diei izaw?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama tungtang mipite phunna Pharisee-te in a za vua, tuale siempu liente le Pharisee-te in ama man dingin biehinncing palihte a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Note tawh bakhat sung beh ka om ding a, tua ciengin keima ei sawlpa kungah ka pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keima nei suisui vangun nei mu sih ding uhi; ka opna ah nang pei thei sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jew mite in, “Eite in ama i mu zawh lo nadingin hei sung pei sawm adiei? Greek-te lahah a Kithethangte kungah va pei-in Greek-te’ thu va hil sawm adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />‘Note in nei sui ding vua, nei mu sih ding uhi,’ a ci thu le, ‘Ka opna ah nang pei thei sih ding uhi,’ a ci pen bang a ci nopna adiei?” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pawi ven ni le a ni thupi ni-in, tua sungah Jesu a din laitahin ama kiko a, “A dangta khatpo ka kungah hing pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />kei ei um poma in hing kidawn taheh. Lai Siengtho in a gen bangin, ‘Thu-um pa’ lungtang panin hinna guntui a luong ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tu-in ama in tam bang a ci ciengin ama a um mite in a nga ding uh Hlagau thu gen ahi hi; azieh pen Jesu kipatawi nai lo ahi ziehin Hlagau a om nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in tam thute a zah ciengun mipite lahah pawlkhat in, “Tampa pen kamsang tahtah ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Adangte in, “Tampa pen Messiah ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Hizongle pawlkhat in, “Galilee gam panin Messiah ang pieng tahtah mawh ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lai Siengtho in Messiah pen David’ suon ahi a, David’ tenna Bethlehem khuo pana ang pieng ahi hi, ci hi lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama ziehin mipite lahah kikhenna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amate lahah mi pawlkhat in ama a mat nuom vangun koima in ama tungah a khut uh a nga sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin, “Ama bang dinga nang mat lo uh ahei?” ci-in a na dong siempu liente le Pharisee-te kungah biehinncing palihte a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Palihte in, “Tampa gen bangin koima in gen ngai nai lo hi!” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharisee-te in, “No zong ang kisol zo ta hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Thunei vaihawmte ahi sihle Pharisee-te lahah ama a um mi khat beh a om ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Thukham a thei lo tam mihonpite samsiet thuoh ahi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Amate lahah Jesu kunga a haw ngai Nicodemus in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Amate in bang teng sem ci kan masa lopi-in i thukham in mite thu a khen ngai ngel amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Amate in, “Nang zong Galilee mi hi lo na mah? Galilee panin kamsang koima pieng ngai lo hi, ci thu kan lacin na thei ding hi,” ci-in a dawng uhi. [
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate a unpi-un a inn ciet vuah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua laitahin Olive Muol tungah Jesu a pei to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingmawng khuova patin biehinnpi ah ama a peikia hi. Ama kungah mi zosie a pei vua, tuale ama to-in thu hil a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thukham theite le Pharisee-te in a angkawm laitaha a kiman numei khat peipi-in amate zosie mai-ah a dingsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Jesu kungah, “Sie aw, tam numei nu a angkawm laitaha kiman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thukham laibu sungah Moses in tam bangte suong tawh selia dingin thu a pie hi. Nang in bang na gen diei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami thu pen ama tungah mawmatna pawlkhat a nei thei nadingun ama zelah nadinga a gen uh ahi hi. Jesu zong kunsuhin a khutme tawh tuolah lai a giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a dawh teitei ciengun Jesu dingtang to-in amate kungah, “Note lahah maw nei lo khat pen in suong tawh ama sep masa heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama khatvei kunsuh kia-in a khutme tawh tuolah lai a gielkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua thu a zah bepun a tapen panin khat khatin a gelmang uhi. Jesu le a mai-a ding numei nu beh a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu dingtang to-in ama kungah, “Numei aw, amate hei sieng ta uh ahei? Khat beh in ang mawmat sih amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua nu in, “Siepa, koima in ei mawmat sih,” a ci hi. Tuale Jesu in, “Ke’n zong kang mawmat sih hi. Pei inlen mawna bawlkia nawn sin,” a ci hi.]
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khatvei Jesu in amate kungah, “Keima leitung khuovah ka hi hi. Ka nua ei zui poma khuomiel ah pei loin hinna khuovah a nei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharisee-te in ama kungah, “Nangma’ thu nangma in teci na pang hi; na teci panna man lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu in, “Keima’ thu keima in teci ka pan vangin ka teci panna pen a man ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile kei hei panin hing pei-in hei lam zuon ding ka hei, ci ka thei a, ahi vangin note in kei hei pan hing pei-in hei lam zuon ding ka hei, ci na thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in mihing dan tawh thu na khen uhi; ke’n koima thu ka khen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khen tama leng zong, ka thukhenna a man ahi hi; azieh pen thukhen kei beh hi loin keima le ei sawl Pa tawh ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na thukham sung vuah mi ni’ teci panna a man ahi hi, ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima’ thu keima in teci ka pang a, keima ei sawlpa ahi Pa in zong keima tangin teci a pang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “Na Pa hei-a om ahei?” a ci uhi. Jesu in, “Note in kei nei thei sih vua, ka Pa zong na thei sih uhi. Note in kei ei thei hi locin ka Pa zong na thei ding uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam thu teng pen biehinnpi sumkholna innkhan sunga ama in thu a hil laitaha a gen ahi a, ahi vangin ama hun tung nai lo ahi ziehin koima in ama man lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in khatvei amate kungah, “Kei a peikhie ding ka hi ta a, note in kei nei sui ding vua, hizongle na mawna sung vuah na si ding uhi. Ka peina-ah note nang pei thei sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jew mite in, “Ka peina ah nang pei thei sih ding uhi, ci ahi ziehin ama le ama a kithat ding khat ahi ta diei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Note pen nei lam pan na hi vua, kei pen tunglam pan ka hi hi; note pen tam leitung mi na hi vua, kei pen tam leitung pan ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in na mawnate ziehun note na si ding uhi, azieh pen note in kei ama kici pa ka hi lam nei up sih uleh na mawnate uh ziehin na si ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Nang koi na hei?” a ci uhi. Jesu in amate kungah, “A cil a patin na kung vua kang gensa bang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note tungah gen ding thu le mawsah nading thu tampi ka nei hi; ahi vangin kei ei sawlpa thuman a, keima in ama tung panin ka zah tam thute beh leitungah kang gen hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in Pa’ thu a gengen ahi lamtah amate in a tel sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu in, “Mihing Tapa na khaito zaw ciengun kei ama ka hi lamtah nei thei ding vua, tuale keima in ka thu tawh bangma bawl loin Pa ei hil banga thugen ka hi lam note in nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Keima ei sawlpa keima tawh a om hi; ama in kei guoh ei nuasie ngai lo hi, azieh pen ama’ lungkimna bangin ka gamta zing hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in tua bangin a gen ciengin mi tampi in ama a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama a um Jew mite kungah, “Ka thute nei zui peisuoh uleh ka nuazui tahtah na hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuale note in thuman thutah zong na thei ding vua, tua thuman thutah in note ang suohtasah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in, “Kote Abraham suonlehlahte ka hi vua, koima sila-in ka om ngai sih uhi. ‘Note ang kisuohtasah ding hi,’ bang dinga na ci thei ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, mawna a bawl zosie mawna’ sila ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sila in inn sungah munkip a nei sih hi; tapa in tua sungah kumtawn ading mun a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaci’n Tapa in ang suotatsah leh suohta tahtahte na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Keima in Abraham suonlehlahte na hi lam uh ka thei hi; hizongle ka thu in na sung vuah mun nga lo ahi ziehin note in kei tha nading hun lemtang na sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Keima in Pa opna munah ka musate kang gen a, note in Pa kung pana na zahte uh na sep ding uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Abraham ka pa uh ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Jesu in, “Abraham’ tate na hi uleh Abraham’ septe na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in Pasien kung pana ka zah thuman a gen pa kei lah nei tha sawm vanuh uhi. Tam pen Abraham bawl dan ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Note na hi ule na pa uh’ sep banga a sem tahtah na hi uhi,” a ci hi. Amate in, “Ko zawlta ka hi sih uhi; kote in Pasien mama ahi Pa khat beh ka nei uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Pasien na Pa uh ahileh kei nei it ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile kei pen Pasien kung pana ang pei ka hi a, tu-in tanah ka om hi. Keima’ thu-a ang peitawm ka hi sih a, ama’ ei sawl ka hi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Bang dinga ka thugen na tel thei lo uh ahei? Azieh pen ka thu na ngai nop lo zieh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />No pen na pa uh dawimangpa kung pana ang pei na hi vua, na pa uh’ deina banga bawl ding na teel uhi. Ama pen a cil a patin mithat pa ahi a, ama sungah thuman thutah a op lo ziehin thuman thutah a tukip sih hi. Ama in zuouthu a gen ciengin ama’ pienzie tawh kituohin a gen hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama zuou gen pa le mizuou theite’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in thuman ka gen ziehin nei um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Note lahah koi in kei nei mawmat uh ahei? Thuman thutah gen ka hi leh bang dinga nei up lo uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pasien kung pana pei poma in Pasien’ gente a za hi. Note in na zah lona uh a hang pen Pasien kung pan na hi lo zieh uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jew mite in ama kungah, “Nang Samaria-te na hi a, dawivei na hi hi, kang ci uh a man hi lo amah?” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesu in, “Kei dawivei ka hi sih hi; keima in ka Pa ka zatah a, ahi vangin note in kei nei zatah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hizongle keima guoh’ minthan nading ka sui sih hi; ka minthan nading a sui khat om a, tuapa khu thukhen ding pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, “Mi khatpo in ka thu a zui leh sina a mu ngai sih ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jew mite in ama kungah, “Nang dawivei na hi lamtah tu-in kang thei uhi. Abraham lah si zo a, tua ma bangin kamsang teng zong a si zo uhi; hizongle tu-in nang in, ‘Mi khatpo in ka thu a zui leh sina a ciem kha ngai sih ding hi,’ na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuale a sisa ka pa uh Abraham sanga lienzaw-a kigen na hi amah? Kamsang teng zong si sieng zo uhi. Nang koi-a kigen na hiei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Jesu in, “Kei le kei ka kiminthansah leh tua ka minthanna pen a mawhna a suoh ding hi. Keima ei minthangsah pa pen, ‘Ama ka Pasien ahi hi,’ na ci uh ka Pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Note in ama na thei sih vua, ahi vangin ke’n ama ka thei hi; ama ka thei sih hi, ci leng note bangin mizuou ka hi ta ding hi. Ahi vangin ke’n ama ka thei a, a thu zong ka mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na pa uh Abraham in keima’ hun a mu ding a kipah mama hi; tuale ama in mu-in a lungdam mama hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jew mite in ama kungah, “Kum sawm nga zong na phah nai lopi Abraham na mu ta ngel amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, Abraham pien masangin keima ka om zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in a se nading uh suong a tung vua, ahi vangin Jesu kiphuolin biehinnpi panin a gelmang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lampi-ah Jesu a pei laitahin a pienpi mittaw mipa khat a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nuazuite in ama kungah, “Sie aw, tampa mittaw sa-a ang pienna pen koi pen’ mawna zieh ahi diei? Ama mawna zieh ahi diei? Ahi sihle a nu a pate’ mawna zieh a hizaw diei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu in, “Ama’ mawhna zieh ahi sih a, a nu a pate’ mawna zieh zong ahi sih hi; ama tungah Pasien’ nasepna a kilah thei nadingin a suo-a kipanin a mittaw sa-a ang suoh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni a op sungin kei ei sawlpa’ na i sem ding hi; koima in na a sep thei lo zan hun ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitunga ka om laisie kei pen leitung khuovah ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami thu a gen kawmin tuolah a cil sie a, cil tawh buon a meh zaw ciengin a mit buon nupiehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Pei inlen Siloam buolah na mai va phiet ta’n,” ci-in a sawl hi. (Siloam kici pen Sawl a cina ahi hi.) Tua ciengin ama pei-in a mai phiet a, khuo mu theisa-in a kinuale kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nidang lai-in khudaw ngen banga a oplai a mu a vengte le ama a mungaite in, “Khutdaw ngen a na to let pa khu tampa hi lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawlkhat in, “Ama ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Adangte in, “Ama hi laizang sih, a kisutpi khat hi bo,” a ci uhi. Ama in, “Kei tuapa ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in ama kungah, “Tua ahile na mit bang ang ci vah theikia ahiei” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Jesu kici mi khat in buon mehin ka mit ang nu zaw ciengin Siloam buolah pei inlen na mai va phiet ta’n, ei ci bangin kei zong pei-in ka phiet leh khuo mu theikia ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Tua pa hei-a om ahiei?” a ci uhi. Ama in, “Thei sing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in Pharisee-te kungah tua mittaw pa a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu in ama buon nu-in a mit a vahsah ni pen Sabbath ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharisee-te in zong tua pa kungah a mit khuomu dan a dongkia uhi. Ama in, “Tua mipa in ka mit buon ei nupiehin ka mai ka phiet leh khuo mu theikia ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pharisee-te pawlkhat in, “Tam mipa in Sabbath ni tang lo ahi ziehin Pasien kung pan hi lo ding hi,” a ci uhi. Ahi vangin adangte in, “Mawnei mi khat in tam bang lim lamdangte bangci bawl thei ding ahei?” a ci uhi. Tuale amate lahah kikhenna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in mittaw pa kungah, “Tua pa in na mit hing vahsah ci lei nang in ama koi hi va na ci ei?” ci-in a dongkia uhi. Ama in, “Kamsang khat hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jew mite in ama mittaw ngai-in khuo a mu thei lam mit khuomu pa’ nu le pate a hlat masangsie a tahsang thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale amate kungah, “Pienpi mittaw na ci uh na tapa uh tam pa ma ahi amah? Tua ahile bangci dan a tu-a khuo a mu theikia ahei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nu le a pate in, “Tam pa pen ka tapa uh ahi a, kote in pienpi mittaw ahi lam ka thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahi vangin bangci danin tu-in khuo mu thei a, koi in a mit a vahsah ahei, ci ka thei sih uhi. Ama kidawh un; ama zong mi khangcingsa ahi ziehin ama’ thu ama in ang gen na ding hi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nu a pate in Jew mite a giin ziehun tam banga a gen uh ahi hi; azieh pen mi khatpo Messiah danin a kigen leh Jew mite kikhopna inn panin kinotmang ding hi, ci-in thukimna a neisa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a nu le a pate in, “Ama a khangcingsa hi, ama kidawh un,” a na ci uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in a niveina mittaw pa hlankia-in ama kungah, “Pasien phat in! Kote in tam pa pen mawnei mi khat ahi lam ka thei uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in, “Mawnei mi ahile ahi lo ka thei kha sih hi. Mittaw ka hi a, tu-in khuo ka mu ta hi, ci thu khat beh ka thei hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Ama in nang tungah bang ang bawl ei? Na mit bang ang ci vahsah ei?” ci-in a dongkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in, “Kang gen zo ta a, note in na ngai nuom sih uhi. Bang dinga na zah nuom sawnsawn uh ahei? Note zong ama’ nuazui suoh nuom na hi ta uh amah?” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in ama kungah, “Nang ama’ nuazui na hi a, ko ka hi ule Moses’ nuazuite ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasien in Moses a hopi lam kote in ka thei vua, ahi vangin tam pa hei sung pana ang pei ahei, ci ka thei sih uhi,” ci-in a engho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua mipa in, “Ama in ka mit ei vahsah ta ngiangua a, note in lah ama hei sung pana ang pei ci na thei lo uh lamdang sam ei izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasien in mawnei mite’ thu ngai loin, ama bie-in ama’ deina banga a gamta mite’ thu a ngaipieh hi, ci i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lei piencil a kipanin pienpi mittaw a damsah koima kiza ngai nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasien kung pana ang pei hi sihle ama in bangma bawl thei lo ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in, “Mawna bulomtang lah pana suoh hi napicin bang dinga thu ei hil sawm meumo na hei?” a ci uhi. Tuale amate in tua pa a notmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua mittaw pa a nawmang dawh uh Jesu in za a, ama in tua pa a mu ciengin, “Mihing Tapa na um ei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua pa in, “ Siepa, ama koi ahiei? Ama ka up thei nadingin ei gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Ama na mu zo hi; nang ang hopi pa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua pa in, “ Topa aw, ken ka um ta hi,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in tua pa a bie pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesu in, “Khuo mu thei lote in khuo a mu nading ule khuomu theite in a mu thei lo nadingun thukhen dinga leitunga ang pei ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama kunga a om Pharisee pawlkhat in tam thu a zah ciengun ama kungah, “Ko zong mittaw ka hi ta uh amah?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesu in, “Mittaw hi locin note in mawna na nei sih ding uhi. Ahi vangin tu-in note in, ‘Khuo ka mu uhi,’ na ci ziehun na mawna uh a omlai hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“A tahtah a kang ci-in, tuu khumna tunkot panin lut loin lampi tuom panin kato-in a lut poma guta le misuom ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tunkot pana lut mipa ahile a tuute a cing pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tunkot cingpa in ama kot honin tuute in ama’ aw a za uhi. Ama in tuute a min tawh hlanin a pusuopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama-a’ zosie a pusuopi zaw ciengin a mai-ah pei-in tuute in ama’ nua a zui uhi, azieh pen tuute in ama’ aw a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuute in a melmahte uh’ nua a zui sih ding vua, a melmahte uh’ aw a thei lo ziehun ama kung panin a gelmang ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu in amate tawh tam thugentena a zah vangin bang thu gen ahei, ci a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, kei pen tuute lutna tunkot ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mai-a pei zosie guta le misuomte ahi uhi; ahi vangin tuute in a thu a mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei tunkot ka hi hi. Keima tungtawnin a lut poma kihundam ding a, sungtum pusuohin lodawnna mun a mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Guta pen a gu ding, a that ding le a susie ding behin ang pei hi. Kei ka hile amate in hinna a nei thei nading ule hinna bukim a nga thei nading vua ang pei ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kei tuucing hoi ka hi hi. Tuucing hoi in a tuute adingin a hinna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuucing ahi lo, tuu zong a nei lo, a kiciel tuucing in ngie pei a mu ciengin a tuute nuasie-in taimang a, tua ngie in tuute manin a thezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama a kiciel ahi bo ziehin tuute don loin a taimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima tuucing hoi ka hi hi. Kei-ate ka thei a, kei-ate in zong kei ei thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pa in kei ei thei bangin ke’n zong Pa ka thei hi. Keima in tuute adingin ka hinna ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami tuu khumna sunga a om lo tuu dang zong ka nei lai hi. Tuu khumna ah tuate kang peipi valon ding a, amate in ka aw a ngai ding uhi. Tuaci’n tuuhon khat, tuucing khat a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hinna ka lahkia thei nadingin ka hinna ka pieh ziehin Pa in keima ei it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koima in keima tung panin ka hinna ei lahpieh lo a, keima thu-a ka pieh ahi zaw hi. Keima in pieh thei nading thu ka nei a, lahkia thei nading thu zong ka nei hi. Keima in tami thupieh pen ka Pa kung pana ka nga ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tami thute ziehin Jew mite a kikhen leuleu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi tampitah in, “Ama pen dawivei ahi a, a maw ahi bo hi. Bang dinga ama’ thu na ngai uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adangte in, “Tam bangte pen dawivei khat’ thugen ahi sih hi. Dawivei khat in mittawte’ mit a vahsah thei ding amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum hunin Jerusalem ah Ki-apna Pawi om a, tua pen phalbi hun sung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biehinn huong sunga Solomon talap ah Jesu a pei kawikawi laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a kimkotah Jew mite kikhawmin ama kungah, “Nang in bang tanvei lung nawngkai-in kote ei koi ding na hei? Messiah na hi leh siengtahin ei gen pai ta’n” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu in, “Ke’n kang gen zo a, na tahsang paupau sih uhi. Ka Pa’ min tawh ka sep zosie in keima’ thu teci a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka tuute na hi lo ziehun nei um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka tuute in ka aw a za uhi. Keima in amate ka thei a, amate in ka nua ei zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima in kumtawn hinna amate ka pie a, amate a kisie ngai nawn sih ding uhi. Ka khut sung panin koima in ka tuute ei lahpieh zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka Pa ei piehsate adang zosie teng sangin lienzaw a, ka Pa’ khut sung panin koima in ei lahpieh zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka Pa le kei pumkhat ka hi uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jew mite in ama a se nadingun suong a tung leuleu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesu in, “Pa kung panin nasep hoi tampi kang lah zo hi. Tuate lahah bang pen zieha suong tawh nei se sawm uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jew mite in, “Nasep hoi zieha kang se sawm uh ahi sih a, nang mi maimai khat kimlai Pasien bangin nang kibawl a, ama na simmawbawl zieh ahi zaw hi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in, “Na thukham bu sung vuah, ‘Keima in note pen pasien-te kang ci hi,’ ci in kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pasien’ thu a tunna mite pen, ‘pasien-te’ kici ahile-Lai Siengtho lah kiphiet thei lo cileih-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />keima in, ‘Pasien’ Tapa ka hi hi,’ ka ci ziehin Pa in siensuo-in leitunga a sawl pa ahi keima kungah Pasien na simmawbawl hi, ei ci thei na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pa’ nasepte a sem lo ka hi leh ei up da mai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuate sem napi a, nei up nop phiel sih uleh zong tua a nasepte beh um un. Tuaci’n note in keima sungah Pa omin kei zong Pa sunga ka op lamtah thei-in na telsiem ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in ama mat ding a hanciemkia vua, ahi vangin amau’ khut sung panun ama a suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jordan gun kantanin ama peikia a, John in mite a baptize masahna munah tungin tuanah a om suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama kungah mi tampi pei a, “John in lim lamdang a bawl lo vangin tam mipa tungtang John’ thu gen zosie man hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mi tampi in khum munah ama a um uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mary le a sanggamnu Martha opna Bethany khuo-ah Lazarus kici mi khat a ci a na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mary kici nu pen sathau namtui tawh Topa nu-in a sam tawh a keng nawtpieh nu ahi a, a sanggampa Lazarus dam loin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n a sanggam numei gel in Jesu kungah thu a puoh vua, “ Topa aw, na it mipa a ci na hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in tua thu a zah ciengin, “Tami natna pen si nading natna ahi sih hi; tua tungtawnin Pasien Tapa’ min a than thei nading le Pasien’ min a kithansah thei nading hizaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu in Martha, Martha’ sanggamnu, le Lazarus te a it mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lazarus dam lo a zah zaw ciengin a opna munah ni ni a tambe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin a nuazuite kungah, “Judea gamah peikia vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nuazuite in, “Siepa aw, Jew mite in tu mama-in suong tawh selia ang sawm uhi, tua sunga peikia ding na mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu in, “Sun khuovah hun nai sawm le nai ni sung hi lo amah? Sun hun sunga lam peite in leitung khuovah a mu ziehun a kipalkha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin zan lai-a lam peite in khuovah a op lo ziehin a kipalkha uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in tam a cizaw ciengin amate kungah, “I lawmpa uh Lazarus a kimu ahi a, ahi vangin ama phong dingin ka pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nuazuite in, “ Topa aw, ama a kimu a hi bo leh ang nuom tuom na va,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in a sina thu gen hi napi, amate in a kimut ngaina maimai gen a sa lel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah sieng tahin gen a, “Lazarus si zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in na up thei nadingun tua sunga ka op lona pen note adingin ka kipah mama hi. Ahi vangin ama kungah pei vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kopsuo a kici Thomas in a guol nuazuite kungah, “Ama tawh siton dingin va zui ta vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu a tun ciengin Lazarus han sunga a op zaw ni li bang pha zo ci a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bethany pen Jerusalem tawh kinai-in tai ni bang kigamla a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a sanggampa uh a si ziehin ama gel hlai dingin Mary le Martha-te kungah Jew mite tampi a haw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Martha in Jesu ang haw hi, ci a zah ciengin ama dawn dingin pei a, tua laitahin Mary inn ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Martha in Jesu kungah, “ Topa , nang tana om hi poma lacin ka naupa a si vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu nangawnin zong ama kunga na nget popo Pasien in ang pie ding hi, ci ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu in tua nu kungah, “Na sanggampa thokia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Martha in ama kungah, “Ni tawp ni, thawkia ni ciengin ang thokia ding hi, ci ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Keima thawkiana le hinna ka hi hi. Kei ei umte a si vangin a hingkia ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a hing a keima ei um mi zosie a si ngai nawn sih ding uhi. Tami thu na um ei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Martha in, “Ka um hi Topa aw, nang pen leitunga ang pei ding Pasien’ Tapa Messiah na hi hi, ci ka um hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam thu a gen zaw ciengin tua nu a kilekia a, a naunu Mary hlanin, “Siepa tanah om a, nang ang hlan hi,” ci-in a va dap hopi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mary in tam thu a zah ciengin thakhatin tho-in ama kungah a pei pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khum hunin Jesu khuo sung lut nai loin Martha tawh a kimuna munah a om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Inn sungah ama hlai-a a om Jew mite in kintaha a pusuoh Mary a mu uhi. Amate in hanah a kap dinga pei ding hi va, ci-in a ngaisut ziehun a nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesu opna munah Mary a tun ciengin ama mu a, a keng zungah khupbawhin, “ Topa aw, nang tana a om hi poma lacin ka sanggampa a si vawt sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jesu in Mary le ama a zui Judah-te’ kaa a mu ciengin a nangeh na mama a, zong lunggim mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in, “Hei sunga na siel uh ahiei?” a ci hi. Amate in, “ Topa aw, hing pei inlen hing en in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu kaa a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jew mite in, “En un, nah it sam ei!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate pawlkhat in, “Mittaw mit khuo musah thei pa in tampa zong a si lo nadingin bawl thei lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu zong a lunggim kawmin han lam zuonin a pei hi. Tua han pen leihawm ahi a, suongtum khat tawh kisin ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesu in, “Tua suongtum ladawh un,” a ci hi. Mi sipa’ sanggam nu Martha in ama kungah, “ Topa aw, a si zaw ni li pha ta ahi ziehin namsie ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Na up leh Pasien’ minthanna na mu ding hi, hing ci zo hi lo ka mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in suongtum a ladawh uhi. Tuale Jesu dahto-in, “Pa aw, ka thumna nei ngai ziehin ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka thumnate nei ngai zing lam ka thei a, ahi vangin tam sunga a ding mihonte in, nangma’ ei sawl ahi lam ei up thei nadingun amate adingin thu ka ngen hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tam thu a gen zaw ciengin, “Lazarus aw, hing pusuoh in!” ci-in nahpi-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A misi pa a khut le a keng diel tawh kituomin, a maitang puon tawh kitunsa-in a pusuoh hi. Jesu in amate kungah, “Phel unlen peisah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mary kunga a haw Judah mi tampite in Jesu’ nasep a mu ziehun ama a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharisee-te kungah pawlkhat pei-in ama’ nasepte a va gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempu liente le Pharisee-te in vaihawm uliente khawmin, “Bang i law ta bep ding vuoi? Tam pa in lim lamdang tampi a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tam banga i opsahsah mawh leh mi zosie in ama hing um ding a, Rome-te hing pei-in i siengtho mun le i minam buppi ang susie ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate lahah tuami kum a siempu lien a sem Caiaphas a kici pa in amate kungah, “Bangma thei vawt sih uteh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Minam buppi khat a kisiet lo nadingin mi tampi tanga mi khat a si pen note adinga a hoizaw ahi lam na thei sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tam thu pen ama’ nop thu-a a gen hi loin tuami kum a siempu lien sem ahi ziehin minamte adinga si ding ahina thu le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />minamte ding beh hi loin, a kithethang Pasien’ tate pawlkhat a gawmtuo thei nadingin a si ding ahina thu kamsangpa bangin ama in thu mavang a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua ni-a kipanin amate in Jesu tha ding a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Jew mite lahah a langtangin Jesu a pei nawn sih a, tua mun panin gamlah tawh kinai Ephraim kici khuo ah pei-in a nuazuite tawh tua munah a om suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tu-in Judah-te’ Peisan Pawi nai ta a, pawi kipat masangin a kisiensuo dingin gam sung khuote panin Jerusalem ah mi tampi peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Amate in Jesu sui kawikawi-in biehinn sungah a ding vua, “Bang na ci ngaisut vuoi? Pawi ang sim lo tahtah ding adiei?” ci-in khatlekhat a kidong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Azieh pen siempu liente le Pharisee-te in Jesu a mat thei nadingun Jesu’ opna a thei na op uleh ei hil ta un,’ ci-in thupiehna a nei zo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Peisan pawi kipat ding ni guh a sap ni-in, sina pana kithosah Lazarus’ opna Bethany khuo ah Jesu a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah amate in ama nitah an a va uhi. Martha in an bawlin Lazarus pen ama tawh ankuong a imton pawlte lahah khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mary in a manpha mama nard kici sathau namtui bung khat la-in Jesu’ keng nupieh a, a sam tawh tuate a nawtpieh hi. Tua sathau namtui gim in innsung teng zelmang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin a nuazuite lahah khat ahi Judas Iscariot (ama lezua ding pa) in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tami sathau namtui denarii za thum tawh zua-in bang dingin tua sum mizawngte kihawmpieh lo ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Tam bang a gen ciengin mizawngte a khuol zieh hi loin, ama mi guta khat ahi zieh ahi hi; ama in sum-ip kemin a sunga sum kikoite a la thei zel hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu in, “Ama nu tuaci opsah lel un. Ama nu in ka kivui ni cienga zah dingin tuate lei-in a koi hi kha thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note na hi ule mizawngte tawh na omton zing ding vua, kei ka hile note tawh ka omton zing sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua munah Jesu a op lamtah Judah mihon tampite in a thei ciengun Jesu zieh beh hi loin, sina panin ama in a thawsahkia Lazarus zong ve kawm dingin amate a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu liente in Lazarus zong tha a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama hangin Judah mi tampi in amate taisanin Jesu a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A zing ciengin pawi sim mihon tampite in Jerusalem lamah Jesu pei ci a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in lutu baate tawi-in ama dawn dingin a kuon vua, “Hosanna! Topa’ min tawh ang pei Israel Kumpi pa in thupha nga taheh!” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu in laano khat mu-in a tungah a tuong hi. Tami thu Lai Siengtho sungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Zion tanu aw, zau sin. En in, na kumpipa uh hing pei-in, laano tungah a tuong hi!” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nuazuite in tam thu a cilin a thei sih uhi; ahi vangin minthanna tawh Jesu a thawkia zaw bepin amate in Jesu’ thu tam bangin na kigiel a, ama tungah tam bangin na kibawl hi, ci-in a nua phaw pan na bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n han sung panin Lazarus hlan dawhin sina panin ama a thawsahna thute, khumlai-a ama kunga om mihonte in teci a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu in tam bang lim lamdang a bawlna thu mihonte in a zah ziehun ama dawn dingin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharisee-te khatlekhat kiho-in, “Thei un, bangma na law zo ta sih uhi. En un, leitung mi zosie in ama a zui sieng ta uhi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawi hun sungin Pasien bie dinga a peite lahah pawlkhat Greek mi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Galilee gam Bethsaida khuomi Philip kungah amate haw-in, “Siepa aw, Jesu ka mu nuom uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Philip pei-in Andrew kungah a gen hi; tua ciengin Andrew le Philip zong pei-in Jesu kungah a gensawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Mihing Tapa a minthan ding hun a tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, lei-ah mangbuhum tang khat kie-in a si phot sih leh, tang khat beh ma om den ding hi; ahi vangin a si leh ga tampi a ga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A hinna a it mite in mansuo ding a, tami leitunga a hinna a muda mite in kumtawn hinna a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka na a sem poma in ka nua ei zui kul a, ka opna ah ka nasempa zong a om ding hi. Ka na a sem poma Pa in a patawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tu-in ka lungsim a gim mama hi. Tuale bang ka gen ta diei, ‘Pa aw, tam hun panin ei hunkhie in,’ ka ci ta ding amah? Hi lo hi, tam thu hang tawh tami hun a ang pei ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pa aw, na min thangsah ta’n,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin vantung panin aw khat ging a, “Ka thangsah zo a, khatvei ka thangsahkia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua munah a om mihonpite in za-in vanto ahi hi, a ci uhi. Adangte in, “Vantungmi khat in ama hopi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu in, “Tami awging pen kei ading ahi sih a, note dinga ang ging hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu-in tam leitung in thukhenna thuoh ding uhi; tu-in tami leitung uhpa kihawlkhie ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuale leitung panin ei kikhaito ciengin keima lamah mi zosie ka kai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in tam bang thu a gen ciengin a si cienga bangci dan a si ding ci a lah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihonpi in, “Messiah pen a om zing ding ahi hi, ci thukham bu panin ka thei uhi. Nang in bang dinga Mihing Tapa kikhaito ding hi, na ci thei ahei? Tami Mihing Tapa koi ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Note tawh khuovah bakhat sung beh om lai ding hi. Khuomiel in note ang phah lo nadingin khuovah na nei petun pei un. Khuomiel sunga na pei uleh hei lam pei ci na thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khuovah’ tate na suo thei nadingun note in khuovah na nei petun tua khuovah um un,” a ci hi. Jesu in tam thu a gen zaw ciengin pei-in amate kung pan a kiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesu in amate muna-ah lim lamdang tampi lah nanle amate in ama a um tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kamsang Isaiah in: “ Topa aw, ka thugen uh koi in um a, koi tungah Topa’ ban thahat kilang ahei?” ci-a a thugen a tangtun thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuale amate in a um zo sih uhi, azieh pen kamsang Isaiah in zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Amate in a mit utawh en loin, a lungtang utawh thei-a ang kihei lo nadingun, ama in a mit uh tawsahin, a lungtang uh a khausah hi. Tua hi sihle keima in amate ka damsah kha ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Isaiah in a minthanna mu ahi ziehin ama’ thu tam banga a gen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahi vangin vaihawm thuneite nangawn in ama a um uhi. Pharisee-te in kikhopna inn pan a nawmang ding a zau ziehun amate in a pulah ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in Pasien’ patah ding sangin mite’ patah ding a deizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Kei ei um poma in kei ei um hi loin kei ei sawlpa um hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kei ei mu poma in kei ei sawlpa zong a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kei ei um poma in khuomiel sungah a op lo nadingin leitungah khuovah banga ang pei ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ka thugente za-in a zui lo mi khatpo tungah keima in thu ka khen sih hi, azieh pen leitung thu khen dinga ang pei ka hi sih a, leitung hundam dinga ang pei ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kei ei nielin ka thugen a sang lo mi pa in thukhenpa khat a nei hi; nitawp ni ciengin ka gensa thu teng pen thukhen pa-a ang pang ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kei nop thu tawh a gen ka hi sih a, ei sawl Pa in bang genin bang sut ding ci-a ei thupieh teng a gen ka hi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama’ thupiehte kumtawn hinna ahi, ci ka thei hi. Tua ahi ziehin ka gen thute ahile Pa in gen in, ei ci banga a gen ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Peisan pawi masangin Jesu in leitung panin a Pa kunga a pei ding hun tung ta hi, ci a thei hi. Ama in leitunga a it ama’ mite a tawp dongin a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu a leheh dingin Simon Iscariot’ tapa Judas’ lungtangah dawimangpa in ngaisutna koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa in ama’ khut sungah na zosie pie-in ama pen Pasien kung pana ang pei hi a, Pasien kunga peikia ding ahi lam zong Jesu in thei ahi ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />sabuoi panin ama dingto a, a puontuol suo dawhin mainul khat tawh a kawng a gah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in kuong sung khatah tui sungin a nuazuite keng a silpieh a, a kawnga a viel mainul tawh nawtpieh ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Topa aw, ka keng ei silpieh laizang ding na hi amah?” a ci Simon Peter kungah ama a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu in, “Tu-in bang bawl ka hei, ci na thei sih a, ahi vangin a nua ciengin na thei ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Peter in ama kungah, “Ka keng na sil ngai poma sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Jesu in, “Na keng kang silpieh sih leh kei tawh a kipawl lo na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simon Peter in ama kungah, “ Topa aw, ka keng guoh hi loin ka khut le ka lu zong ei silpieh vet in!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “A kipumsilsa mi in a keng longal sil ding a kisam ta sih a, a pumpi zosie a siengsa ahi hi. Tuale note na unpi-un na sien vangun na sieng kim sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in a leheh ding pa a thei hi; tami thu ziehin ama in, “Na unpi-un na sieng kim sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a keng uh a silpieh zaw ciengin a puontuol sil a, anneh sabuoi lamah kilekia-in a kung vuah, “Note adinga ka septe na thei vuoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei pen Siepa le Topa nei ci vua, tua pen a man ahi hi, azieh pen nei ci bangun ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n na Topa ule na Siepa uh ahi keima in na keng uh hing silpieh ka hi leh note in zong khatlekhat na kisilpieh ding uh a kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in na tung vua ka bawl banga note in zong na bawl thei nadingun ette dinga kang pieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, nasemte pen a pupa sangin lienzaw lo a, a kisawl pa zong a sawl pa sangin lienzaw lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam thute thei-in tuate na zui uleh mi hampha na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na unpi vua ang gen ka hi sih hi; keima in ka teelsa mite ka thei hi. Ahi vangin tami pen Lai Siengtho sungah, ‘Ka an a ne mipa in a aketul tawh ei peh hi,’ ci-a a kigen thu a tangtun thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tami thu a pien ciengin kei ama ka hi lam nei thei nadingun tu-in a pien masanga ang magen ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, ka sawl mi a sang poma in kei zong ei sang hi a, kei ei sang mi poma in kei ei sawl pa zong a sang ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in tam thu a gen zaw ciengin a lungkham mama a, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, note lahah khat in kei ei leheh ding hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Koi pen gen ahei, ci-in a nuazuite khatlekhat a ki-en uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu in a it a nuazuite lahah khat pa in Jesu nehin ama zomah a kingam phei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Simon Peter in a mit-heh tawh ama hopi a, “Koi a ci nopna adiei,” ci-in Jesu dong dingin a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu lamah ama a zamphei laitahin, “ Topa aw, koi ahei?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu in, “Kuong sungah khomun halkhat ka die zaw cienga ka pieh ding pa ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi. Tuaci’n khomun halkhat a die zaw ciengin ama in Simon Iscariot’ tapa Judas a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in khomun halkhat a san zaw ciengin a sungah Satan a lut pai hi. Jesu in ama kungah, “Na bawl dingte nawbawl ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bang dingin ama kungah tam thu a gen adiei, ci thu sabuoi-a omte koima in thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawlkhatte in Judas pen taangpi sumkem ahi ziehin Jesu in ama kungah, “Pawi cienga i tulmaw ding vante va lei ta’n,” ci-a a sawl ahi sihle, mi zawngte bangkhat pie dinga a sawl hi ding hi, ci-in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n khomun halkhat a san zaw ciengin thakhatin a pusuoh pai hi. Tua hun pen zanlai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judas a pusuo zaw ciengin Jesu in, “Tu-in Mihing Tapa kipatawi a, ama sungah Pasien a kipatawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama sungah Pasien a kiminthansah leh Pasien in zong ama sungah Tapa’ min a thangsah ding a, thakhatin ama’ min kithangsah pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka tanote aw, note tawh bakhat sung beh ka om ding hi. Note in kei nei sui ding uhi; tuale Jew mite kungah, ‘Ka peina munah nang pei thei sih ding uhi’ ci-a ka gen bangin tu-in zong note kungah kang gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Note khatlekhat na ki-it nadingun keima in note tungah thupieh tha khat kang pie hi. Keima in note kang it bangin note zong khatlekhat na ki-it un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Note khatlekhat na ki-it uleh tam thu ziehin mi zosie in ka nuazuite na hi lamtah uh ang thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simon Peter in ama kungah, “ Topa , hei-a pei ding na hei?” a ci hi. Jesu in, “Tu-in ka pei nading munah nei zui thei sih ding hi; ahi vangin nualam ciengin nei zui thei ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Peter in ama kungah, “ Topa , bang zieha kang zui thei lo ding ahei? Nang adingin ka hinna kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesu in, “Kei adingin na hinna nei pie ngam diei mah? A tahtah a kang ci-in, aah khuon masangin thumvei nei niel ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Note kilungkhamsah sih un. Pasien um unlen kei zong ei um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka pa inn sungah op nading mun tampi a om hi. A om lo hileh na op nading uh mun siem dingin ka va pei ta ding hi, ci-in kang gen ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei pei-in note adingin opna ding mun ka va siem tah leh, ka opna munah no zong nang op thei nadingun no ang la dingin kang peikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note in ka pei nading mun na thei uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thomas in, “ Topa , na pei nading ka thei sih uhi. Kote in lampi bangci thei ding ka hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Keima in lampi, thuman thutah, le hinna ka hi hi. Kei ei suong loin Pa kungah koima tung thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima nei thei uleh ka Pa zong na thei ding uhi. Tu-a kipanin ama thei-in, na mu zo ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Philip in, “ Topa aw, Pa ei lah in, tua hile ka lung a kim ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Philip aw, nang tawh tami hun sung zosie hing omton sam ing a, kei ei thei nai lo na hi amah? Kei ei mu poma in ka Pa a mu zo ta hi. Bang dingin, ‘Pa ei lah in,’ ci thei na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pa sungah kei ka om a, kei sungah Pa a om hi, ci na um sih amah? Na kunga kang gen thute keima’ thu-a kang gen ahi sih hi; kei sunga a teng Pa in ama’ na a sem hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pa sungah kei ka om a, kei sungah Pa a om lamtah note in um un; na up sih uleh, ka sepsate ziehin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, keima ei um mi in keima’ sep nate ma a sem ding a, kei Pa kungah pei ta ding ka hi ziehin tamte sangin a lienzaw nasepte a sem lai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tapa sunga Pa a kipatawi nadingin keima’ min suonga na nget popo uh keima in kang bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima’ min suongin note in kei kungah na khatpopo nang nget uleh kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Kei nei it uleh ka thuciemte na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in Pa kungah thu ka ngen ding a, ama in note ang ompi zing dingin adang Hupa khat ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitung mite in tua thuman Hlagau Siengtho pen mu thei lo, theithei lo uh ahi ziehin a sang zo sih uhi. Note tawh ama ang tenton ziehin ama na thei vua, tuale note sungah ama ang om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Note a taga dingin kang nuasie sih ding hi; na kung vuah kang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung in bakhat sung ei mu nawn lo ding a, ahi vangin note in nei mu ding uhi; kei ka hin ziehin no zong na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Pa sungah kei ka om a, kei sungah no omin, no sungah kei ka op lam note in na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka thupiehte nei-a, a zui mite pen keima ei it ahi uhi; kei ei itte in ka Pa zong it ding a, ke’n zong amate it-in amate tungah kei le kei ka kilah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judas (Iscariot ahi lo) in, “ Topa aw, leitunga kilah lo pi-in, ko tungah nang le nang bang ang ci kilah thei ding na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu in, “Kei ei itte in ka thu zui-in ka Pa in amate it ding a, amate kungah kote pei-in ka tengton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei ei it lo poma in ka thu a zui sih hi; tu-a na zah uh thute kei-a’ ahi sih a, kei ei sawl Pa-a’ ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Note tawh ka opton lai-in na kung vuah tam thute kang gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pa in keima’ min tawh ang sawl ding Hupa Hlagau Siengtho in na zosie ang hil ding a, ama in na kung vua kang gensa thu zosie ang phawhsahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima in note tungah lungnopna kang nuasie hi; note tungah ka lungnopna kang pie hi. Keima in leitung mite pieh bangin kang pie sih hi. Kilungmangsah sih unlen zong zau sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Keima ka va pei ta ding a, na kung vuah kang peikia ding hi,’ ci ka gen thu na za zo uhi. Kei nei it uleh Pa kunga pei ding ka hi ziehin na kipah ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile kei sangin Pa a lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam thu ang pien tahtah ciengin na up thei nadingun a pien masangin na kung vua kang magen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu-in leitung thu vaihawmpa ang pei zo tah ziehin note tungah thu tampi kang gen ta sih ding hi. Ama in keima tungah thuneina bangma a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pa ka it lamtah leitung mite in a theithei nadingin Pa ei thupieh bangin ka sem hi. Ding un, tam panin pei ta vai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kei lengga gui tahtah ka hi a, ka Pa pen lengga lonei pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in keima sunga a ga lo baa zosie a paimang ding hi. Ga nei a baate a ga semsem nadingin ama in heu-in a hasieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima in note kunga kang gen thute ziehin note ang siengthosah zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note sunga ka op bangin note zong keima sungah om un. Lengga baa pen lenggui tawh a kizop sih leh a matanga a ga thei lo bangin, no zong kei tawh na kizop sih uleh ga na ga thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima lengga gui ka hi a, note a baa na hi uhi. Keima sungah tengin amate sunga kei ka ten leh amate in ga tampi a ga ding uhi, azieh pen kei loin note in bangma na bawl thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei sunga a om lo poma a kipaimang a baate bangin a vulgawp hi; tua bang a baate kikhawm a, meikhuh sungah kipai-in a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima sungah na op vua, note sungah ka thu a op leh na dei popo ngen locin note adingin ang kibawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ga tampi ga-in ka nuazui na suona ziehun note in ka Pa’ min na thangsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pa in kei ei it bangin ke’n zong note kang it hi; keima’ ang itna sungah om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka Pa thupiehte zui-a ama’ itna sunga ka op bangin, note in ka thupiehte na zui uleh keima’ itna sungah na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note sungah ka kipahna a op thei nading le note’ kipahna a bukim thei nadingin na kung vuah tam thute kang gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tami pen ka thupieh ahi hi, keima in note kang it bangin note zong khatlekhat khat na ki-it un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lawmte adinga a hinna a pie ngam itna sanga a lienzaw itna koima in nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in ka thupiehte na zui uleh ka lawmte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note pen nasemte kang ci nawn sih ding hi, azieh pen nasempa in a pupa’ sep bang ahei, ci a thei sih hi; keima in lawmte kang cizaw hi, azieh pen keima in ka Pa kunga ka thuzah zosie note kang theisah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note in kei nei teel sih vua, keima in note kang teelzaw hi. Tuale note pei-in a kimang zing ding gate a ga dingin kang se zo hi. Tuaci’n keima’ min suongin note in ama kunga na nget popo uh Pa in ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Note khatlekhat na ki-it nadingun keima in tami thupieh kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Leitung mite in note ang muda leh, note ang muda masangin kei ei muda zo hi, ci thu thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note pen leitung-a’ na hi uleh leitung in ama-a’ bangin ang it ding hi. Note pen leitung-a’ hi loin leitung pana kang teelsa na hi ziehun leitung in note ang muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note kungah, ‘Nasemte pen a pupa sangin lienzaw lo hi,’ ci-a kang thugen phawh un. Amate in ei bawlsiet uleh no zong ang bawlsie ding uhi; amate in ka thugen a man uleh no-a’ zong a mang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima’ min ziehin amate in na tung vuah tamte zosie ang bawl ding uhi, azieh pen amate in kei ei sawlpa a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate kungah pei-in thu gen lo hi leng amate a maw sih ding uhi; hinanle tu-in amate in a mawna tungtang vuah hamlap ding a nei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei ei muda poma in ka Pa zong a muda ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate lahah koima dang’ bawl ngai lo nate va bawl ta sih leng amate a maw sih ding uhi. Ahi vangin tu-in amate in ka sil bawlte a mu zo vua, kei le ka Pa ei muda ton uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thukham sung vuah, ‘Thu om lopi-in kei ei muda gumsan uhi,’ ci-a a kigiel thu a tangtun nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Pa kung pana ang pei, thuman thutah Hlagau Siengtho ahi Pa kung panin na kung vua kang sawl ding Hupa ang pei ciengin kei tangin teci ang pang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A cil a kipanin kei tawh omton na hi ziehun note in zong keima tungtang teci na pang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Note na puakhah lo nadingun keima in na kung vuah tam thute kang gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in kikhopna inn panin note ang nawmang ding uhi. A tahtahin, no ang thatte in tua banga a bawlna uh ziehin Pasien bie-a a kingaisut ding uh hun ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in Pa ahi a, kei ka hi zongin ei thei lo ziehun tam bang ang sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin a hun uh ang tun ciengin tam thute kang gensa ahi lam na phaw nading vua tu-a kang gen ahi hi. “A kipat cilin note tawh ka opton ziehin na kung vuah tam thute kang gen vateh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in ei sawlpa kungah ka pei ta ding hi; koima khat beh in, “Hei-a pei ding na hei? ci-in nei dong vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam bang ka ci ziehin lah na da mama vanuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin thuman thutah kang gen hi: Kei pei leng no adingin a hoizaw hi, azieh pen kei pei sih leng na kung vuah Hupa ang pei sih ding hi; kei ka pei leh na kung vuah ama kang sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama ang tun ciengin leitung mite’ mawna, dihna le thukhennate kawhin leitung mite’ khielna teltahin ang lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mawna thu-ah, amate in kei ei up lo ziehun a maw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dihna thu tawh kisai-in, Pa kungah ka pei ding a, nei mu nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thukhenna thu-ah, tam leitung uhpa in mawsah thukhenna a thuoh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na kung vua kang gen ding thu tampi om lai hi, hizongle tu-in na sang thei nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuman Hlagau Siengtho ang tun ciengin ama in thuman zosie-ah ang pui ding hi; azieh pen ama’ thu ang gen ding hi loin, a thu zah popo ang gen ding hizaw a, na kung vuah ang tung ding nate ang gen ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in kei-a’ teng la-in note kunga ang gen ding ahi ziehin ama in ka min a thangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pa neisa zosie kei-a’ ahi hi. Tami thu ziehin ama in kei-a’ teng la-in na kung vuah ang gen ding hi, a ci ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Bakhat sung kei nei mu nawn sih ding vua, bakhat zaw ciengin nei mukia ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nuazuite pawlkhat khatlekhat kiho-in, ‘Bakhat sung nei mu nawn sih ding vua, bakhat zaw ciengin nei mukia ding uh,’ a ci le, ‘A zieh pen ka Pa kungah ka pei ding hi,’ ci-a i kunga ang gen pen bang a cinopna ahi diei?” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in, ‘Bakhat sung a ci pen bang a ci na adiei? Ama bang gen ahei, ci i thei sih uhi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A dot nop lam uh Jesu in a thei ciengin amate kungah, ‘Bakhat sung kei nei mu nawn sih ding vua, bakhat zaw ciengin nei mukia ding uhi,’ ka ci pen kidong na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, note kapin na mau ding vua, ahi vangin leitung mite a lungdam ding hi; note na da ding vua, ahi vangin na danate uh lungdamna a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Numei khat in a tasuo hun tung ahi ziehin a na a thuoh hi. Ahi vangin nau a suo ciengin leitungah nausen khat a pien ziehin lungdamin a gimthuoh teng a phawhkha nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n note in tu-in gimna na thuoh uhi; hizongle keima in note kang mukia ding a, na kipah ding uhi, note kung panin koima in na kipahna uh ang lahpieh thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin note in bangma nei dong ta sih ding uhi. A tahtah a kang ci-in, keima’ min suongin Pa kunga na nget popo uh ama in ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka min tawh tu dongin bangma na ngen nai sih uhi. Na lungdamna uh a bukim thei nadingin ngen un, na nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Keima in note tungah thugentena tawh tam thute kang gen zo hi. Thugentena tawh ka gen nawn lo ding hun ang tung ding a, Pa tungtang thu cientahin kang genzaw ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin note in keima’ min suongin na ngen ding uhi. Keima in note tangin Pa kungah hing ngetpieh vang a ci ka hi sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />azieh pen note in keima ei itin, Pa kung pana ang pei ka hi lam nei up ziehun, Pa mama in zong note ang it ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pa kung pan hing pei-in leitungah kang tung zo hi; leitung nuasie-in Pa kungah khatvei ka peikia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nuazuite in, “Hi hi, tu-in thugen tena zang loin cientahin na gen hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu-in na zosie na thei a, koima’ dawh kisam lo hi, ci ka thei tah ziehun, Pasien kung pana ang kipan na hi lam kang um ta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu in, “Tu-in nei um ta sam vuoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Note kithethangin na inn ciet uh zuonin kei guoh nei nuasie ding uh hun ang tung ding a, tu-in ang tung tahtah ta hi. Ahi vangin Pa tawh omton ka hi ziehin kei matang ka hi sam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Note in keima sungah lungnopna na nei thei nadingun na kung vua tami thu kang gen ahi hi. Note in leitungah gimna na thuoh ding uhi. Ahi vangin kihangsansah un; keima in leitung ka zozo hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in tam thu teng a gen zaw ciengin vantung ento-in, “Pa aw, a hun ang tung ta hi; Tapa in na min ang thansah thei nadingin nang in na Tapa’ min hing thangsah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile ama na piehsa mi zosie tungah ama in nuntah tawntungna a pieh thei nadingin mi zosie tungah thuneina ama na pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale amate in nang beh Pasien man tahtah na hina le na sawlpa Jesu Khris a thei siemna uh pen kumtawn hinna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in sep dinga nei pieh nasep ka mansiengna tawh leitungah na min ka thangsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pa aw, leitung pien masangin na kunga ka neisa minthanna tawh tu-in na omna munah ei minthangsah ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Leitung mite sung panin nei piehsate tungah keima in na min ka kitheisah zo hi. Amate nangma-a’ hi a, nangma in kei tungah amate nei pie zo ta a, amate in na thu a mang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in ahile amate in kei nei pieh zosie nang kung pan ahi lam a thei ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />azieh pen kei nei pieh thute ma amate ka pie a, amate in zong tua thute a sang vua, nangma kung panin thuman thutah sunga ang pei ka hina thu amate in a thei uhi; tuale amate in nangma’ ei sawl ka hi lam zong a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kema in amate tangin thu kang ngetpieh hi; leitung mite adingin thu ka ngen sih a, nei piehsa mite adingin thu ka ngenzaw hi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate nangma-a’ ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima’ neisa zosie nangma-a’ hi a, nangma’ neisa zosie zong keima-a’ ahi hi; tuate sungah keima ei kiminthangsah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in leitungah ka om nawn sih hi, ahi vangin amate pen leitungah a omlai vua, kei ka hile nangma kungah kang pei ta ding hi. Siengtho Pa aw, ei gel pum khat i hi ma bangin amate zong pumkhat a suo thei nadingun, na min tawh keima nei piehsa amate dal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate tawh ka opton laitahin nei piehsa amate na min tawh ka kem zo hi. Amate ka dal a, Lai Siengtho a tangtun nadingin a mangthai dinga kilaitansa mipa khat simlo koima khat beh a pelem a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in na kunga ang pei ding ka hi ta a, amate mama sungah ka lungdamna bucing a nei thei nadingun leitung ka op lai-in tami thute ka gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in amate tungah na thu ka pie zo hi, kei leitung-a’ ka hi lo ma bangin amate zong leitung-a’ ahi lo ziehun leitung in amate a muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leitung panin amate na lahkhiet ding ang ngen ka hi sih a, gilopa kung panin na dal ding ang ngen ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei pen leitung-a’ ka hi lo ma bangin amate zong leitung-a’ ahi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuman thutah sungah amate na siensuo in; na thu in thuman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leitungah kei nei sawl ma bangin, kei zong amate leitungah ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuman thutah sungah amate zong a kisiensuo thei nadingun, amate ka khuolna-in keima le keima ka kisiensuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tam mite ading beh ang ngen ka hi sih a, amau’ thugenna ziehin keima ei um ding mite adingin zong ang ngen ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pa aw, kei nei sawl lam leitung mite in a up thei nading ule kei sungah nang na om a, nang sungah kei ka op bangin, amate zong eite sungah omin a unpi-un pumkhat a suo thei nadingun thu kang ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang le kei pumkhat i suo bangin amate zong pumkhat a suo thei nadingin keima in nei pieh minthanna amate ka pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate pumkhat a suo sieng thei nadingun amate sungah kei ka om a, kei sungah nang na om hi, tuaci’n kei leitunga nei sawl ahi lam le kei nei it bangin amate zong na it lam leitung mite in a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pa aw, nei piehsate in zong leitung pien masanga kei nei it zieha nei piehsa ka minthanna a mu dingin ka opna ah kei tawh amate ang op ding uh ka lunggul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“A thuman ka Pa aw, leitung mite in ang thei sih vangin keima in nang kang thei hi; tuale tamte in zong kei nei sawl lam a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate na min ka theisah zo ta a, amate sungah kei nei itna za itna a op thei nading le, amate sungah kei ka op thei nadingin keima in na min ka theisah lai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in tam teng a gen zaw ciengin a nuazuite tawh Kidron kuom kantanin khum munah a om um khat sungah a nuazuite tawh a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum mun pen Jesu in a nuazuite a kimupi zelna mun ahi ziehin a leheh pa Judas in zong a mun a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Judas in siempute le Pharisee-te kung panin galkap honkhat le palihte zawpi a, lalcin, meila, le galhiemte tawi-in a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama tunga a pieng ding thu zosie a thei zo tah ziehin va pei-in amate kungah, “Koi sui na hi vuoi?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in, “Nazareth mi Jesu,” ci-in a dawng uhi. Jesu in, “Kei, ama ka hi hi,” a ci hi. Ama leheh pa Judas zong amate tawh a dington hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Kei, ama ka hi hi,” ci-in a gen ciengin amate nuakinin tuolah a pua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu in, “Koi pen sui na hi vuoi?” ci-in a dongkia hi. Amate in, “Nazareth mi Jesu sui ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu in, “Kei, ama ka hi hi, ci-in kang gen zo ta hi. Tuaci’n kei ei sui na hi uleh tam mite peisah ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam pen, “Nangma in kei nei piehte khat beh ka mansuo sih hi,” ci-a a gensa thu a tangtun nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Simon Peter in a namsau kuo dawhin siempu lienpen pa’ sila khat a sat leh a bil zietlam a bantan hi. Tua silapa’ min Malchus ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu in Peter kungah, “Na namsau a paai-ah sietkia in. Pa in ei piehsa hai dawn lo ding ka mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n galkapte, a galkap bupa, le Judah palihte in Jesu manin khau tawh a khi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua kuma siempu lien a sem Caiaphas’ sungpa Annas kungah a peipi masa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Caiaphas kici pa pen mipite’ tangin mi khat a si ding hoizaw hi, ci-in Judah mite thumop pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simon Peter le a nuazui dang khat in Jesu a zui uhi. Siempu lien pa le nuazuipa a kimelthei ziehin siempu lien pa’ inn huong sungah Jesu tawh a lutton hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahi vangin tunkot pulamah Peter a ding hi. Tuaci’n siempu lien pa tawh a kimelthei tua nuazui dang khat pusuohin kotcing numei nu hopi a, Peter zong a lutpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua numei nu in Peter kungah, “Nang zong tam pa’ nuazuite lahah khat hi lo na mah?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Hi sing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dam a nat ziehin silate le palihte in meihol a taw vua, mei awi-in a kimkotah a ding uhi. Peter zong amate tawh dingin mei a awi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu lien pa in Jesu kungah a nuazuite thu le a thuhilna tawh kisai thute a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu in, “Keima in leitung mite mai-ah a langtangin ka gen zo hi; Jew mite zosie’ kisuhtuona ahi kikhopna innte le biehinnpi sungah thu ka hil zing a, bangma ka dapgen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang dinga nei dawh ahei? Ka thugen a zasate kungah bang ka gen ahei, ci va kidawh ta’n. Amate in bang ka gen ci a thei uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in tam teng a genzaw ciengin a gei-a a ding palihte khat in Jesu phebeh a, “Siempu lien pa tam banga na dawn ding ma amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu in, “Ka genkhiel leh ka khielna ei lahtel in. Ahi vangin mantaha ka gen ahile bang dinga nei phebeh ahei?” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Annas in Jesu khaukhisa-in siempu lien pa Caiaphas kungah a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mei awi-in Simon Peter a din laitahin amate in, “Nang zong ama’ nuazuite khat hi lo na mah?” ci-in a dong uhi. Ama in, “Hi malmal sing,” ci-in a niel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu lien pa’ silate lahah Peter in a bil a satpieh pa’ sanggamte khat in, “Ama tawh um sungah hing mu hi lo ka mah?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Peter zong kilepin nielkia leuleu a, tua hun lienin aah a khuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in Caiaphas inn panin Pilat’ kumpi inn ah Jesu a peipi uhi. Tua hun pen zingmawng phalva pat ahi hi. Biehna ngaina tawh kisai bua bannate tawh kipelin Peisan pawi a neh thei nadingun kumpi inn sungah amate a lut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pilat pusuohin, “Tam pa na mawmat nopna uh bang ahei?” ci-in amate dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in, “Tam pa in sietna a bawl lo hi leh na kungah kang ap sih ding uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pilat in, “Ama peipi ulen, noma’ thukham bangin ama tungah thu kikhen ta un,” a ci hi. Jew mite in, “Kote in mi tha thei nading thu ka nei sih uhi,” ci-in a dawngkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />(Tam pen bangci banga sina thuoh ding ci, Jesu in a gensa thute a tangtun nading ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kumpi inn sungah Pilat tumkia-in Jesu hlansah a, “Nang, Judah-te’ Kumpi na hi amah?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in, “Nangma’ ngaisut tawm a nei dawh amah, ahi sihle midangte in na kunga kei thu ang gen ahei?” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pilat in, “Kei Judah mi ka mah? Na mite le siempu liente in ka kungah nang ei ap zo hi. Bang ahiei na bawl?” ci-in a dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu in, “Ka kumpi gam pen tami leitung pan ahi sih hi. Ka kumpi gam tami leitung pan hileh Jew mite khut sunga ka tun lo nadingin ka nuazuite in a do ding uhi. Ahi vangin ka kumpi gam pen tam sung pan ahi sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pilat in, “Tua ahile nang kumpipa na mah?” ci-in a dong hi. Jesu in, “Nei ci bangin kumpi ka hi hi. Tami thuman teci pang dingin ang suoh ka hi a, tami thu ziehin leitunga ang pei ka hi hi. Thuman thutah-a pang zosie in ka aw a ngai uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pilat in, “Thuman thutah bang ahei?” ci-in a dong hi. Ama in tami thu a gen zaw ciengin Jew mite kungah pusuohkia-in, “Ama mawsah nading thu ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peisan pawi hun sungin note adingin mi khat ka hla thei nading ngaina khat na nei uhi. Judah kumpipa kang hlakhiet ding na nuom vuoi mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in, “Tam pa hi lo, Barabbas hlazaw in!” ci-in nahpi tahin a kiko uhi. Barabbas pen misuom khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pilat in Jesu kai-in a satsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale galkapte in ling tawh kumpi lukhu khat phanin a lu tungah a khusah vua, puontuol ausan khat a silsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama kungah amate pei den mielmuolin, “Jew mite kumpipa na khan sau taheh,” ci-in a mai a beng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pilat pusuoh kia-in amate kungah, “En un, ama mawsah thei nading bangma thu ka mu lo lam na thei nadingun na kung vuah ama kang peisah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n ling lukhu khukawm le puontuol ausan silkawmin Jesu a pusuoh hi. Pilat in amate kungah, “En un, mipa tanah om hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siempu liente le palihte in ama a mu ciengun, “Singlamte tungah khailia un! Singlamte tungah khailia un!” ci-in a awng uhi. Pilat in amate kungah, “Noma ma in la unlen singlamte tungah kikhailia ta un; kei ka hile ama tungah mawmat ding ka mu sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jew mite in ama kungah, “Kote in thukham khat ka nei vua, ama Pasien’ Tapa a kici ziehin thukham dung zui-in a si dinga kilawm ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilat in tami thu a zah ciengin nidang sangin a zauzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kumpi inn ah ama lutkia-in Jesu kungah, “Nang hei pana hing pei na hiei?,” ci-in a dong hi. Hinanle Jesu in kam khat beh dawng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pilat in ama kungah, “Kei ei hopi lo ding na hi amah? Nang hla thei nading le tha thei nading thu ka nei lam tah na thei sih amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Tunglam pana ang kipieh sih leh kei tungah thu na nei thei sih ding hi; tua ahi ziehin nang tunga kei ei piekhie pa in mawna lienzaw a bawl hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum hun a kipanin Pilat in ama hla thei nading sui a, ahi vangin Jew mite in, “Tam pa na hla poma leh Caesar’ lawm na hi sih hi. Ama le ama kumpi a kibawl popo Ceasar langpang ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilat in tam thute a zah ciengin a pulamah Jesu peipi a, Hebrew hamin Gabbatha a kici Suongpha muna a om thukhenna topha tungah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khum ni pen Peisan pawi dinga Kigin ni hi a, sunkim pawl ahi hi. Ama in Jew mite kungah, “Na kumpipa uh tanah om ei!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in, “Ama that in! Ama that in! Singlamte tungah khailia in!” ci-in a kiko uhi. Pilat in amate kungah, “Na Kumpipa uh ka khailia ta diei mah?” ci-in a dong hi. Siempu liente in, “Caesar simlo kumpi dang ka nei sih uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pilat in khailia dingin amate khutah Jesu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Jesu peipi-in ama’ singlamte ding ama in puo a, Hebrew hamin Golgotha a kici Lutang Gu Mun-ah a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in singlamte tungah Jesu le adang mi nite tua munah a khailia uhi. Ama langtuoh ah adang nite kikhai-in a lai-ah Jesu kikhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pilat in zong lai khat gielsahin, “Nazareth khuomi Jesu, Judah Kumpipa,” cisah a, singlamte tungah a suongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jew mite tampitah in tua lai kigiel a sim uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile Jesu kikhaina mun pen khuopi tawh kinai hi; tuami lai pen Hebrew lai, Latin lai, le Greek laite tawh kigiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah siempu lien pente in Pilat kungah, ‘Judah-te Kumpipa’, ci-in giel sinlen, “ Tam pa in kei Judah kumpipa ka hi hi,’ a ci hi, ci-in gielzaw in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilat in, “Ka gielsa, ka gielsa ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Singlamte tungah Jesu a khailia zaw ciengun galkapte in a puonsilte la-in phal li a suo vua, phal khat cietin a tang uhi. Amate in a puon tungsil zong a la uhi; tua pen a lu panin a taw donga khui lo-a kigan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in, “Tami balkeh sih vai, koi pen in i nga ei aisan vai,” khatlekhat a kici uhi. Tam pen Lai Siengtho in, “Amate in ka puonte a hawm vua, ka puon-ah nga nadingin ai a san uhi,” a ci thu a tangtun nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galkapte in tam bangin a bawl uhi. Tua laitahin Jesu’ singlamte gei-ah a nu, a nu’ sanggamnu, Clopas’ zi Mary, le Mary Magdalene-te a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu in a nu panga a ding a it mama nuazuipa a mu ciengin ama in a nu kungah, “Numei aw, tanah na tapa om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in nuazuipa kungah, “Tanah na nu om hi,” a ci hi. Khum hun a kipanin a nuazui pa in a inn ah ama a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Jesu in vai zosie mansieng zo ci a thei ciengin (Lai Siengtho a tangtun nadingin), “Ka dang a ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua munah lenggazu thua a dim bel khat kitung hi. Tuaci’n amate in tua sungah tuihup a die vua, hyssop ba dawnah taa-in Jesu’ kam tawh a tuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu in tua lenggazu a dawn zaw ciengin, “Kizo zo hi,” ci-in lukunin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ni pen Kigin ni ahi ziehin Jew mite in sabbath hun sungin singlamte tungah a luongte nuasie ding a dei sih uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile tua sabbath pen a diehdiehin a lipkhap huoi ni thupi ni ahi hi. Tuaci’n amate in a kikhailum pa’ kengte sattanin a luongte a hepkhiet thei nadingin Pilat kungah a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin galkapte pei-in a masa pa’ keng sattan piehin ama tawh a kikhaiton adang khat pa-a’ zong a sattanpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu kung a tun ciengun ama a sisa-in a mu vua, a kengte a sattan pieh ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua tangin galkapte khat in teipi tawh a pang a sun leh thakhatin sisan le tui a luongkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />(Note in zong tam thu na up thei nadingun tami thu a mu pa in teci a pang hi. Ama’ teci panna thuman ahi a, ama thuman gen ahi lam a kithei hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lai Siengtho in, “A gu khat zong kitawngsah lo ding hi,” ci-in a genna thu a tangtun thei nadinga tam thute ang pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lai Siengtho mundang khat ah, “Amate in a sut pa uh a en ding uhi,” na ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tam thu teng zaw ciengin Jesu’ nuazui khat, Jew mite a giin ziehin a langtanga a zui ngam lo, Arimathea khuomi Joseph in Jesu’ luong a lah thei nadingin Pilat kungah ngen hi. Pilat in zong ama phalna a pie hi; tuaci’n ama pei-in Jesu’ luong a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesu kungah a zan haw ngai pa Nicodemus zong myrrh le aloes kihal pong za bang a gih ding panamtuite tawi-in a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in Jesu’ luong la-in Judah-te’ kivuina ngaina bangin diel sungah panamtui tawh a tun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Singlamte tungah a kikhailiana mun gei-ah um khat om a, tua um-ah koima a kivui ngai nai lona han tha khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jew mite’ Kigin ni ahi zieh leh tua kima han nai pen ahi ziehin tua hanah Jesu a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nipi kal khat sunga ni masa pen ni zingmawng khuomiel laipi-in hanah Mary Magdalene a pei leh ama in hankot sinna suongtum a kiliamangsa a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Simon Peter le Jesu in a it a nuazui dang khat kungah tua nu tai-in, “Amate in han panin Topa a ladawh ta vua, hei-a a siel uh ahei, ci ka thei sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter le adang nuazui pa dingkhie-in han lamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ni tuohun ama gel a taiton vangun nuazui dang khat pa in Peter makhelin hanah a na matun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama kunsuhin a etsuh leh tua munah a kitunna puon kipha a mu a, ahi vangin a sungah ama a lut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama’ nua zui-in Simon Peter pei a, han a tun ciengin han sungah a lut hi. Ama in tua munah a kitunna puon kipha mu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a lu tunna puon zong a luong tunna puon tawh na omton loin a tuomtuohin kizielin a om a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin hanah a na tung masa adang nuazui pa zong a sungah lut a, tuale ama in mu-in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in misite lah panin ama thokia ding hi, ci-a Lai Siengtho genna a theitel nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin nuazuite a inn ciet vuah a peikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin han pulamah Mary dingin a kap hi. A kaa kawmin hankhuh sung lam enin a kunsuh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua nu in Jesu luong kisielna a lu lamah khat, a keng lamah khat, puonpah silin a to vantungmi ni a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama gel in tua nu kungah, “Numei aw, bang dinga kap na hei?” a ci uhi. Tua nu in ama gel kungah, “Amate in ka Topa a lamang ta vua, hei sunga a siel dawh uh ahei, ci ka thei ta sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua nu in tam thu a gen zaw ciengin a kinua hei leh khum sunga a ding Jesu mu a, ahi vangin Jesu ahi lam a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Numei aw, bang dinga kap na hei? Koi ahiei na sui?” a ci hi. Tua nu in huon bawlpa sa a, “Sie aw, nang puohdawh ahile, na koina ei gen in, a luong ka la ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Mary!” a ci leh Mary zong kinua hei-in Hebrew hamin, Rabboni!” ci a, (tua khu Siepa a cinopna ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu in tua nu kungah, “Ei tu sin, bangzieh ahei cile Pa kungah ka peito nai sih hi. Ahi vangin ka sanggamte kungah pei inlen, “Ka Pa le na Pa uh ahi, ka Pasien le na Pasien uh’ kungah ka kato ta ding hi,’ ci hi, ci-in va genzaw ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mary Magdalene zong pei pai-in nuazuite kungah, “ Topa ka mu zo hi,” a ci hi; tua nu in tua pa thugen zosie amate kungah a gensawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nipi kal khat sunga ni masa pen nitahin nuazuite in Judah mite a giin ziehun inn kotkhahte a khah vua, tuale a kikhopna vuah Jesu pei-in amate lahah ding a, “Nopna note tawh ang om taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in tam thu a gen zaw ciengin amate kungah a khutte le a pang zong a lah hi. Nuazuite in Topa a mu ciengun a nuom mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Note tawh nopna om taheh. Pa in kei ei sawl bangin note kang sawl hi,” a cikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam a ci zaw ciengin amate tungah a hu sang a, “Hlagau Siengtho na sang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note in mi khatpo’ mawnate na maisah uleh, tua mawnate kimaisah ding a, mi khatpo’ mawnate na opsah suoh uleh tua mawnate a om suoh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu a pei laitahin amate lahah sawm le nite lahah khat Thomas (a kopsuo kici pa) om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n nuazui dangte in tua pa kungah, “ Topa ka mu ta uhi,” a ci uhi. Ahi vangin ama in amate kungah, “A khut sunga siakil kikhetna pawn mu-in, siakil kikhetna ma vangah ka khutme ka va khum tehteh sih a, a pang zong ka khut tawh ka va tham tehteh sih leh ka um sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zaw nipi kal khat ciengin inn sungah a nuazuite a na omkia vua, Thomas zong amate tawh a omton hi. Kotkhahte a kikha vangin Jesu pei-in amate lahah ding a, “Note tawh nopna om taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Thomas kungah, “Na khutme tawh tamtah tham inlen ka khutte en in. Na khut zah inlen ka pang zong tham in. Umla sinlen muong lenlon in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thomas in, “Ka Topa le ka Pasien!” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Kei nei mu zieha ei um pan na hi bo amah? Kei ei mu lopi-a ei umte mi hampha ahi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu in a nuazuite’ muna-ah tami laibu sunga a kigiel kha lo na lamdang tampitah zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in Messiah hi a, Pasien’ Tapa ahina thu na up thei nading ule tua banga na upna uh tungtawnin ama’ min tawh hinna na nei thei nading vua tam thute kigiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami thu teng zaw ciengin a nuazuite opna Tiberius tuipi gei-ah Jesu kilahkia hi. Ama tam bangin kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah a kisutuo teng pen Simon Peter, a kopsuo kici Thomas, Galilee gam Cana khuomi Nathanael, Zebedee’ tapate, le a nuazui dang nite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simon Peter in amate kungah, “Nga beng dingin va kuon ta vang,” a ci hi. Amate in, “Komate in zong nang zui va ung,” a ci uhi. Amate pei-in gunkuong tungah a tuong vua, hizongle tua zanin bangma a man sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zingmawng khuovah patin gun gei-ah Jesu ding a, ahi vangin nuazuite in Jesu ahi lam a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Tate, nga khat beh na man sih uh amah?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Man sih ung,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in, “Gunkuong zietlam pangah na len uh pai locin pawlkhat na man ding uhi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n len a pai uleh nga tampi awhin a len uh a kai zo ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu in a it nuazui pa in Peter kungah, “ Topa lah ahin!” a ci hi. Simon Peter in Topa ahi lam a zah ciengin ama pen a ngentanga om ahi ziehin puon silin tui sungah a lengsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nuazui dangte zong gunkuong tawh pei-in a len utawh nga a dimletin a kai uhi. Tua mun le gungei pen kigamla lo a, kai za ni bang beh a kigamla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pieugei a tun ciengun meihol kitaw mei-am tungah nga le anlum kihang a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Na nga matte uh tawmkhat hing tawi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n gunkuong tungah Simon Peter kato-in tuipieu-ah len kai dawh a, nga a gol vive za le sawm nga le thum a awh hi. Tua za-a a tam vangin len a ehkeh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Hing pei unlen zing an ne un,” a ci hi. Amate in Topa ahi lam a thei ziehun a nuazuite khat beh in, “Nang koi na hei?” ci-in a dong ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu pei a, tuale khomun la-in amate a pie hi. Tua ma bangin nga zong la-in a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami pen sina panin Jesu a thawto zaw a nuazuite kunga a kilah a thum veina ahi hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zing an a neh zaw ciengun Jesu in Peter kungah, “John’ tapa Simon aw, tamte sangin kei nei it zaw ei mah?” a ci hi. Peter in ama kungah, “Kang itzaw hi Topa . Nang kang it lamtah na thei hi,” a ci hi. Jesu in ama kungah, “Ka tuunote na vah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “John’ tapa Simon aw, kei nei it ei mah?” ci-in a niveina dong leuleu hi. Ama in, “Kang it hi, Topa aw, nang in kang it lamtah na thei hi,” a ci hi. Jesu in ama kungah, “Ka tuunote na cing in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, “John’ tapa Simon aw, kei nei it ei mah?” ci-in a thumveina dong leuleu hi. “Nang in kei nei it ei mah?” ci-in thumvei a dawh ziehin Peter da mama a, tua ahi ziehin, “ Topa , na zosie na thei a, ke’n nang kang it lam zong na thei hi,” a ci hi. Jesu in ama kungah, “Ka tuute na cing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, na khangno lai-in na kawng gahin na nopnopna-ah na pei thei hi. Ahi vangin na khangham ciengin na khutte zahin mi dangte in na kawng gah ding a, na pei nop lona-ah ang peipi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Ama in bangci bang sina tawh Pasien’ min a thansah nading a gen nopna ahi hi.) Tam thu a gen zaw ciengin Jesu in Peter kungah, “Ka nua ei zui-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Peter a kihei leh Jesu in a it a nuazui pa in amate a zui a mu hi. ama pen nitah an a neh laitahun Jesu banah kingamin, “ Topa , nang ang leheh ding pa koi ahiei?” ci-a a dong pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Peter in tua pa a mu ciengin Jesu kungah, “ Topa , ama bangci ding?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu in, “Kang peikia dong cieng ama a hing lai dinga ka dei nah leh nang tawh bang kisai ahei? Keima ei zui-in! a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n a khuopite lahah tami nuazuipa si lo ding hi, ci-in a thu kithang hi. Hinanle Jesu in tami nuazui pa si lo ding hi, ci-in a genkha sih a, “Kang peikia hun dong ama a hing dinga ka dei leh nang tawh bang kisai ahei?” a ci ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam thu teng teci pang le a gielpa pen tami nuazui pa hi a, a teci panna pen thudih ahi hi, ci-in i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in a sep adang na tampite zong omlai hi. Tua teng zosiepi a kigiel sieng hileh leitung in tua a kigiel ding laibu teng kenin ka um va-ia sih hi.
  </para>
</usx>
